[104.540839, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He could hardly stand still, so great was his mental agitation, and he ran towards Holmes with two eager hands\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  outstretched. Thank Heaven that you have come,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Three seconds before the arrival of J. B. Hobson's letter, I no more dreamed of chasing the unicorn than of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  trying for the North West Passage.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The lure proved too much for him, and he came sporting after it, as friskily as a young kitten, much to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Cynthia's delight when she caught sight of him.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Flight was out of the question now. The reptiles rose. They wheeled around our little raft with a rapidity\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  greater than that of express trains.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Again I thank you. This incident, I suppose, will be renewed no more. If I live to be an old woman, I shall\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  remember it thirty years hence as a bright dream.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  A stage meal is popular because it proves to the audience that the actors, even when called Charles Haltry or\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Owen Nairs, are real people just like you and me.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  She spoke with a sudden energy which partook of fear and passion, and flushed her thin cheek, and made her\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  languid eyes flash.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  To meet the needs of this conflict, wretchedness has invented a language of combat which is slang.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Yes, then something better, something still grander will surely follow. Or wherefore should they thus ornament\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  me?\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Relocated footnote. Governor Robinson being on his way east, the steamboat on which he was travelling stopped at\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Lexington, Missouri,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Now Delia contrived to obtain a great influence and ascendancy over the minds of the children by means of these\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  dolls.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  By this time Lord Chelford and Wilder returned, and, disgusted rather with myself, I ruminated on my want of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  generalship.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  They worry me terribly, and besides, I'd like to see what this lovely furniture looks like without such\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  quantities of dust all over it. Good scheme, Sin,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Kathleen waved the torch to and fro as she recited some beautiful lines written for some such purpose as that\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  which called them together to night.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I see they lay helpless and naked, weeping and none to answer, none to cherish thee with mother's smiles.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It will be clear to you from what I have said that only you could have let this young man out since you were\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  left in the room, and must have locked the door when you went out.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The king, who had from this moment become in reality the principal dancer in the quadrille, cast a look upon his\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  vanquished rival.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Pack as much into my trunk as you can, my travelling kit, my suits, shirts, and socks. Don't bother counting,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  just squeeze it all in. And hurry.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  This distinction is vital to the understanding of memory, but it is not so easy to carry out in practice as it\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  is to draw in theory.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Now then, let's enter the city and enjoy the great feast that's being cooked. I'm nearly starved myself, for\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  this conquering kingdoms is hard work.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It was a serious crime indeed, mister Watson told them, and Tom Gates bade fair to serve a lengthy term in the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  state's prison as a consequence of his rash act.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  You may be quite sure it's there, said Captain Battleaxe, and that I can so use it as to half obliterate your\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  town within two minutes of my return on board.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I wanted nothing more than to see my country again, my friends, my modest quarters by the botanical gardens, my\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  dearly beloved collections.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Yes, all alone by himself, asserted Jasper, vehemently, and winking furiously to the others to stop their\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  laughing. He did now, truly, Phronsie.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Women can hide their pain better than we men, and bear it better too, except when shame drops fire into the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  dreadful chalice.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I wish it were recur again, but it will take two or three interviews before the stiffness, the estrangement of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  this long separation will wear away.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In other words, these three men took down the lectures which Luther addressed to his students in the course of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Galatians, and Rohrer prepared the manuscript for the printer.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The Lord who has given us power to teach and to hear, let him also give us the power to serve and to do. Luke\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  two.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Hold, said David, perceiving that with this assurance they were about to leave him, I am an unworthy and humble\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  follower of one who taught not the damnable principle of revenge.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The hawk, embittered by the loss of his first quarry,