[105.751453, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  which thou dost scatter on every little blade of grass that springs, revives the milked cow, and tames the fire\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  breathing steed,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The old servant told him quietly as they crept back to Gamewell that this passageway led from the hut in the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Pleasants to Sherwood, and that Geoffrey for the time was hiding with the outlaws in the forest.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I have never yet, however, been vanquished by them, and even upon this occasion my reason shall combat them to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the last, and my reason shall fail me before I do wrong.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He hoped there would be stew for dinner, turnips and carrots and bruised potatoes, and fat mutton pieces to be\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  ladled out in thick, peppered, flour fattened sauce.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He came down to earth, lived among men, suffered, was crucified, and then he died, standing clearly before us,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  so that our hearts and eyes may fasten upon him.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Nothing is more lugubrious than the contemplation thus in its nudity, in the broad light of thought, of the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  horrible swarming of slang.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  but this frequenter of the heights of air, for all his savage valour, was troubled at the leaping waves and the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  tossing foam of these mad rapids. He did not understand them,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Extinguished brands were lying around a spring, the offals of a deer were scattered about the place, and the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  trees bore evident marks of having been browsed by the horses.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  We can all be servants of God wherever our lot is cast. But he gives us different sorts of work, according as he\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  fits us for it and calls us to it.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  All the morning they trudged up the mountain path, and at noon Unk and Ojo sat on a fallen tree trunk and ate\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the last of the bread which the old munchkin had placed in his pocket.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  But take it whilst I live, and wear Montfichet's shield in the days when my eyes can be rejoiced by so brave a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  sight, for you will ne'er disgrace Ars duchen, I warrant me.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Among the country population its place is to some extent taken by savings and home comforts known through the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  medium of neighbourhood gossip sufficiently to serve the like general purpose of pecuniary repute,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It has even happened that the name for certain diseased conditions of the body arising from such an origin has\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  passed into everyday speech as a synonym for noble or gentle.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It is notable that the Indian tribes have generally regarded the religion of the Latter day Saints with favour,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  seeing in the Book of Mormon striking agreement with their own traditions.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The dull light fell more faintly upon the page whereon another equation began to unfold itself slowly and to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  spread abroad its widening tale.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Whenever, as in these cases, the menial service in question has to do directly with the primary leisure\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  employments of fighting and hunting, it easily acquires a reflected honorific character.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  First as a Paris stockbroker, later as a celebrated author and yachtsman, he went on frequent voyages to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Britain, America, the Mediterranean,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Marie picked cherries and sang softly to herself, stripping one glittering branch after another, shivering when\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  she caught a shower of raindrops on her neck and hair.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It is probable that the relation of the ideas to God or of God to the world was differently conceived by him at\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  different times of his life.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  At most, by an alms given to a beggar whose blessing he fled from, he might hope wearily to win for himself some\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  measure of actual grace.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He would be like a philologist refusing to examine a fact in language, a philosopher hesitating to scrutinize a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  fact in humanity.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In actual fact, there are doubtless various factors that concur in giving us the feeling of greater or less\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  remoteness in some remembered event.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  If beauty or comfort is achieved, and it is a more or less fortuitous circumstance if they are, they must be\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  achieved by means and methods that commend themselves to the great economic law of wasted effort,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Sometimes I don't want to do anything at all, and sometimes I want to pull the four corners of the divide\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  together he threw out his arm and brought it back with a jerk. So, like a tablecloth,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Such consumption as falls through the women is merely incidental to their work it is a means to their continued\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  labour, and not a consumption directed to their own comfort and fullness of life.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Some of the touches, indeed, when the tint has been mixed with much water, have been laid in little drops or\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  ponds, so that the pigment might crystallize hard at the edge.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  For the first day, sir, I think that what you have done gives great hopes of you, and without any doubt you will\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  make rapid progress.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  At one end stood a great fireplace, in which a blue log was blazing with a blue flame, and over the fire hung\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  four kettles in a row, all bubbling and steaming at a great rate.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The tree only came to himself when he was unloaded in a courtyard with the other trees and heard a man say, That\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  one is splendid. We don't want the others.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  As I spoke, I made him a gracious bow, and I think I showed him by my mode of address that I did not bear any\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  grudge as to my individual self.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  You will find me continually speaking of four men Titian, Holbein, Turner, and Tinteret, in almost the same\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[105.751504, "o", "\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  terms.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  When a private in the eighth Cavalry, he had been on the point of quitting the army at twenty eight years of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  age, but unexpectedly he had been appointed orderly to Captain Servadac,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K  \u001b[36m\u001b[1mStock NVIDIA NeMo \u001b[0m [████████████████████░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░] 2,080/2,620 clips  3.04/5.40 h  \u001b[1m 10.18 s\u001b[0m"]
