[106.15534, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He has no traditions to bind him or guide him, and his impulse is to break away from the occupation his father\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  has followed, and make a new way for himself.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Not that I know of, not one more that I know of, he replied, with astonishment at what she had insinuated, and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  yet with a perfect assurance that she was in the wrong.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  delivered in a strong tone of assent, announced the gratification the savage would receive in witnessing such an\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  exhibition of weakness in an enemy so long hated and so much feared.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  She was young, untried, nervous. It was a vision of serious duties and little company, of really great\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  loneliness.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Mindful, however, of her own errors and misfortunes, she early sought to impose a tender but strict control over\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the infant immortality that was committed to her charge,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The night was clear, starlit, and splendid. The tempest had passed away, and the sweet influences of the evening\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  had restored life, peace, and security everywhere.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  But in their selection of a constitution, the Briton Eulists have unfortunately allowed themselves but one\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  deliberate assembly, and hence has sprung their present difficulties.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  That summer the rains had been so many and opportune that it was almost more than Shabata and his men could do\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  to keep up with the corn. The orchard was a neglected wilderness.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It could not be used for electroplating or deposition, nor could it charge storage batteries, all of which are\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  easily within the ability of the direct current,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Love is a babe. Then might I not say so To give full growth to that which still doth grow?\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The only duplicate which existed so far as I knew was that which belonged to my servant, Bannister, a man who\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  has looked after my room for ten years, and whose honesty is absolutely above suspicion.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I believe it, sir, and that is what I fear. Therefore, the principal object of my visit here is to devote myself\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  entirely to the study of the French language.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  We shut our eyes, the flowers bloom on, We murmur, but the corniers fill. We choose the shadow, but the sun that\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  cast it shines behind us still.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Mrs. Gray had met southerners before, but not intimately, and she always had in mind vividly their cruelty to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  poor negroes, a subject she made a point of introducing forthwith.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Oh, to shoot my soul's full meaning into future years, That they should lend it utterance, And salute love that\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  endures, From life that disappears.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Let me say here distinctly to have done with it, that this narrative, from an exact transcript of my own made\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  much later, is what I shall presently give.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  If I go to meeting at all, I like best to sit in the quiet old house in Germantown, where the windows are all\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  open, and I can see the trees, and hear the stir of the leaves.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In a few moments he heard the cherries dropping smartly into the pail, and he began to swing his scythe with\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  that long, even stroke that few American boys ever learn.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Sire, he said, your Majesty's most devoted servant approaches to perform a service on this occasion with similar\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  zeal that he has already shown on the field of battle.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He was a splendid figure of a boy, tall and straight as a young pine tree, with a handsome head and stormy grey\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  eyes deeply set under a serious brow,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The street conductors were of the overhead pole line construction, and were installed by the construction\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  company that had been organized by Edison to build and equip central stations.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The late astounding events, however, had rendered Procope manifestly uneasy, and no"]
[106.155391, "o", "t the less so from his\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  consciousness that the Count secretly partook of his own anxiety.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The people contested these measures one by one in the courts, presenting in case after case the different phases\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of the subject, and urging the unconstitutionality of the measure.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The incident was not violent, nor even dramatic, no posse was summoned, no further effort made, and Reader,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  fearing personal violence, soon fled in disguise.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  She meanwhile passed her life with her parents in the strictest retirement, never letting herself be seen, but\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  shunning every eye lest it should read her misfortune in her face.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It is only a pencil outline by Edward Byrne Jones in illustration of the story of Psyche. It is the introduction\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of Psyche after all her troubles into heaven.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  This person was Rudolfo, who, though he had gone to look for his friends, had changed his mind in that respect,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  not thinking it advisable to acquaint them with what had passed between him and the girl.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Half an hour later, turning a deaf ear to all remonstrance, he gave the proprietors until five o'clock to remove\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  their families and personal property from the Free State Hotel.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the custom of festive gatherings probably originated in motives of conviviality and religion. These motives are\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  also present in the later development, but they do not continue to be the sole motives.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In a few days an officer came with a requisition from Governor Shannon, and took the prisoner by land to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Westport, and afterwards from there to Kansas City and Leavenworth.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  If, however, they take your scalp, as I trust and believe they will not, depend on it, Uncas and I will not\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  forget the deed, but revenge it as becomes true warriors and trusty friends.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I think he was perhaps more appreciative that I was of the discipline of the Edison construction department, and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  thought it would be well for us to wait until the morning of the fourth before we started up.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K  \u001b[36m\u001b[1mStock NVIDIA NeMo \u001b[0m [████████████████████░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░] 2,112/2,620 clips  3.14/5.40 h  \u001b[1m 10.58 s\u001b[0m"]
