[106.45858, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  She taught her daughter, then, by her own affection for it, that love for a country where they had both been\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  hospitably received, and where a brilliant future opened for them.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  At the head of the pinkies were Gipge Sizzle and Button Bright, who had the parrot on his shoulder, and they\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  were supported by Captain Coralie and Captain Tintent and Rosalie the witch.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  So there came a step and a little rustling of feminine draperies. The small door opened, and Rachel entered,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  with her hand extended and a pale smile of welcome.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  To such persons, these indirect modes of training children in habits of subordination to their will, or rather\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of yielding to their influence, are specially useful.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  His specifications for an open sea submarine and a self containing diving suit were decades before their time,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  yet modern technology bears them out triumphantly.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  A gramophone, by the help of suitable records, might relate to us the incidents of its past, and people are not\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  so different from gramophones as they like to believe.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Edison was intolerant of sham and shoddy, and nothing would satisfy him that could not stand cross examination\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  by microscope, test tube, and galvanometer.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Little Pearl, who was as greatly pleased with the gleaming armour as she had been with the glittering\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  frontispiece of the house, spent some time looking into the polished mirror of the breastplate.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  To celebrate the arrival of her son, Sylvia gave a splendid supper to which she had invited all her relatives,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and it was a good opportunity for me to make their acquaintance.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  How comes it that while the first beatitude promises the kingdom of heaven to the poor of heart, the second\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  beatitude promises also to the meek that they shall possess the land?\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The wind never lulls, but to acquire increased strength. The vast bank of heavy clouds is a huge reservoir of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  fearful windy gusts and rushing storms.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The seasons, allies of spring, followed him closely to form a quadrille, which, after many words of more or less\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  flattering import, was the commencement of the dance.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  but poor Rachel Lake had more than that stoical hypocrisy which enables the tortured spirits of her sex to lift\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  a pale face through the flames and smile.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I wish you good night. She laid her bony hands on the back of mister Meadowcroft's invalid chair, cut him short\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  in his farewell salutation to me, and wheeled him out to his bed as if she were wheeling him out to his grave,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Now here is Raphael, exactly between the two, trees still drawn leaf by leaf, wholly formal, but beautiful mist\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  coming gradually into the distance.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Many of these affiliated gentlemen of leisure are at the same time lesser men of substance in their own right,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  so that some of them are scarcely at all, others only partially to be rated as vicarious consumers.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Let us run, then, said all three, and gracefully lifting up the long skirts of their silk dresses, they lightly\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  ran across the open space between the lake and the thickest covert of the park.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  They constitute two different orders of facts which correspond to each other, which are always interlaced, and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  which often bring forth results.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Keep silent as long as may be, and it would be wise, when you do speak, to break out suddenly in one of your\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  shoutings, which will serve to remind the Indians that you are not altogether as responsible as men should be.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Then the Republic of Britanula was to be declared as non existent, and the British flag was to be exalted, and a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  British governor installed in the executive chambers."]
