[106.862311, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Olive had painted the motto on a long, narrow panel of canvas, and, giving it to mister Popham, stood by the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  fireside while he deftly fitted it into the place prepared for it.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Under the simple test of effectiveness for advertising, we should expect to find leisure and the conspicuous\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  consumption of goods dividing the field of pecuniary emulation pretty evenly between them at the outset.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Soon thousands of converts had rented or purchased homes in Missouri, Independence, Jackson County, being their\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  center. But from the first they were unpopular among the Missourians.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Margolot had first made the girl's form from the patchwork quilt, and then she had dressed it with a patchwork\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  skirt and an apron with pockets in it, using the same gay material throughout.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Know then, son of my heart, that this fainting lady is your real bride. I say real because she is the one whom\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  your father and I have chosen for you, and the portrait was a pretense.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Oh, very well, said Gringo, turning away with a shade of contempt. You'll find, if you are going into literature\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and newspaper work, that you can't afford a conscience like that.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Listen then, Socrates, to a tale of Solens, who, being the friend of Dropidas, my great grandfather, told it to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  my grandfather Critias, and he told me.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  A narrow channel formed a passage through the ridge of rocks that protected it from the open sea, and which,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  even in the roughest weather, would ensure the calmness of its waters.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u