tle might call him back, and in a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  few moments he had rounded the curve at the police barrack and was safe.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The governor, on his part, becoming doubtful of the legality of employing Missouri militia to enforce Kansas\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  laws, was also eager to secure the help of Federal troops.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  When this had been accomplished, the boolaroo leaned over to try to discover why the frame rolled away,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  seemingly of its own accord, and he was the more puzzled because it had never done such a thing before.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Her eyes seemed to regard him with mild pity. Her holiness, a strange light glowing faintly upon"]
