[108.578107, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Thousands of handkerchiefs were waving above these tightly packed masses, hailing the Abraham Lincoln until it\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  reached the waters of the Hudson River at the tip of the long peninsula that forms New York City.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the count had thrown himself back on his seat, leaning his shoulders against the partition of the tent, and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  remained thus, his face buried in his hands, with heaving chest and restless limbs.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Then they sped in great haste for the door, and the goat gave a final butt that sent the row of royal ladies all\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  diving into the corridor in another tangle, whereupon they shrieked in a manner that terrified every one within\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  sound of their voices.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Let him come in, then, said the king, and as if Colbert had been listening at the door for the purpose of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  keeping himself accurant with the conversation, he entered as soon as the king had pronounced his name to the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  two courtiers.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Henry Lord, with a degree of PhD to his credit, had been professor of zoology at a New England college, but had\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  resigned his post in order to write a series of scientific textbooks.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Then, turning towards me, he says that I look like a foreigner, and when I say that I am an Italian, he begins\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  to speak to me of the court, the city, of the theatres, and at last he offers to accompany me everywhere.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I don't know and can't say how you fine gentlemen define wickedness. Only, as an obscure female, I speak\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  according to my lights, and he is generally thought the wickedest man in this county.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Why was the sacrament of the Eucharist instituted under the two species of bread and wine, if Jesus Christ be\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  present body and blood, soul and divinity, in the bread alone and in the wine alone?\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Two bites are made, and the bread is crumbled with an air of great eagerness. Indeed, one feels that in real\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  life the guest would clutch hold of the footman and say, Half a mole, chap, I haven't nearly finished. But the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  actor is better schooled than this.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Here she would stay, comforted and soothed among the lovely plants and rich exotics, rejoicing the heart of old\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Turner the gardener, who since Polly's first rapturous entrance had taken her into his good graces for all time.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  So, to the surprise of the Democratic Committee and all his friends, mister Hopkins announced that he would\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  oppose Forbes' aggressive campaign with an equal aggressiveness, and spend as many dollars in doing so as might\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  be necessary.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  When first they entered the throne room they tried to be as haughty and scornful as ever, but the blues who were\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  assembled there all laughed at them and jeered them, for there was not a single person in all the blue country\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  who loved the princesses the least little bit.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  But Pearl, who was a dauntless child, after frowning, stamping her foot, and shaking her little hand with a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  variety of threatening gestures, suddenly made a rush at the knot of her enemies and put them all to flight.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Their diving stone, poised on its rude supports and rocking under their plunges, and the rough hewn stones of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the sloping breakwater over which they scrambled in their horseplay, gleamed with cold wet lustre.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The good natured audience, in pity to fallen majesty, showed for once greater deference to the king than to the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  minister, and sung the psalm which the former had called for.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Another and far more important reason than the delivery of a pair of embroidered gloves impelled Hester at this\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  time to seek an interview with a personage of so much power and activity in the affairs of the settlement.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Here it comes, there it glides, now it is up the ragged stu"]
[108.57832, "o", "mp of the mast, thence it lightly leaps on the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  provision bag, descends with a light bound, and just skims the powder magazine. Horrible\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Broad as the prairies and free in thought as the winds that swept them, he is idiosyncratically opposed to loose\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and wasteful methods, to plans of empire that neglect the poor at the gate.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  A small settlement had been founded by Mormon families on Shoal Creek, and here on the thirtieth of October,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  eighteen thirty eight, a company of two hundred and forty fell upon the hapless settlers and butchered a score.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Since the period of our tale, the active spirit of the country has surrounded it with a belt of rich and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  thriving settlements, though none but the hunter or the savage is ever known even now to penetrate its wild\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  recesses.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  And so life and death have dispersed the circle of violent radicals and dissenters, into which, twenty years\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  ago, the little quiet, resolute clergyman's daughter was received, and by whom she was truly loved and honored.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In other words, while he had implicit faith in the ability of Balaam's ass to speak, he was somewhat sceptical\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  on the subject of a bear's singing, and yet he had been assured of the latter on the testimony of his own\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  exquisite organs.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Unlike his master, he made no pretension to any gift of poetic power, but his inexhaustible memory made him a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  living encyclopedia, and for his stock of anecdotes and troopers' tales he was matchless.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  From the same men new regiments and new companies were formed, different officers appointed, and the whole\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  military force put into such hands as the independents could rely on.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  By a quick and unexpected march, Montrose hastened to Innerlocky and presented himself in order of battle before\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the surprised but not affrightened covenanters.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He did not think of the warm sun and of the fresh air. He did not care for the little cottage children that ran\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  about and prattled when they were in the woods looking for wild strawberries.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  simply by stopping her carriage two or three times before the shop to have her snuff box filled, and by saying\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  aloud to the young girl who handed back the box that her snuff was the very best in Paris.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Time rolled on. The hour of her delivery arrived it took place in the utmost secrecy. Her mother taking upon her\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the office of midwife, and she gave birth to a son, one of the most beautiful ever seen,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Meanwhile, he had called upon me to make a report of the three wire system, known in England as the Hopkinson,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  both doctor John Hopkinson and mister Edison being independent inventors at practically the same time.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  If a rock or a rivulet or a bit of earth harder than common severed the links of the clue they followed, the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  true eye of the scout recovered them at a distance, and seldom rendered the delay of a single moment necessary.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  All the images of his past life floated upon his memory, his thoughts sped away to his native France, only to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  return again to wonder whether the depths of ocean would reveal any traces of the Algerian metropolis.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The child had a native grace which does not invariably coexist with faultless beauty. Its attire, however\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  simple, always impressed the beholder as if it were the very garb that precisely became it best.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K  \u001b[36m\u001b[1mStock NVIDIA NeMo \u001b[0m [█████████████████████████░░░░░░░░░░░] 2,304/2,620 clips  3.79/5.40 h  \u001b[1m 13.02 s\u001b[0m"]
