[109.183008, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In this way the fete of the whole court was a fet also for the mysterious inhabitants of the forest, for\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  certainly the deer in the brake, the pheasant on the branch, the fox in its hole, were all listening.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Just at the moment, when the tears of the pitying beholders flowed fastest, and their ejaculations were most\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  expressive of despair, Leocadia gave signs of recovery, and brought back gladness through the hearts of all.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  At the edge of this box there lies a great wooden doll, which, so far as mutilation is concerned, bears a strong\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  resemblance to the finest Greek sculpture, and especially in the total loss of its nose.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He had for his own town residence a big house filled with the spoils of travel and the trophies of the chase,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  but it was to his country home, an old family place in Essex, that he wished her immediately to proceed.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The wind being adverse, the Dobrina did not make very rapid progress, but as the weather, in spite of a few\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  clouds, remained calm, and the sea was quite smooth, she was enabled to hold a steady course.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  They approached the door, which was of an arched form, and flanked on each side by a narrow tower or projection\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of the edifice, in both of which were lattice windows, the wooden shutters to close over them at need.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Unless he could secure an engine of smoother running, and more exactly govern and regulated than those available\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  for his dynamo and lamp, Edison realized that he would find it almost impossible to give a steady light.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The sentence of Saint James, which says that he who offends against one commandment becomes guilty of all, had\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  seemed to him first a swollen phrase until he had begun to grope in the darkness of his own state.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Since last Thursday I, Gipgezizzle, have been the lawful Boolaroo of the Blue Country. But now that you are\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  conquered by Queen Trot, I suppose I am conquered too, and you have no boolaroo at all.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  She tried this morning an air or two upon the piano, sang a simple song in a sweet but slightly metallic voice,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and then, seating herself by the open window, read Philip's letter.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  When the boy walked through the streets, blessings were showered upon him by all who saw him blessing upon his\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  beauty, upon the mother that bore him, upon the father that begot him, upon those who brought him up so well.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The large letter contains, indeed, entirely feeble and ill drawn figures. That is merely childish and failing\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  work of an inferior hand. It is not characteristic of Gothic or any other school.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  We believe in a literal resurrection, and an actual hereafter, in which future states shall be recognized every\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  sanctified and authorized relationship existing here on earth, of parent and child, brother and sister, husband\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and wife.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  To grow and grow, to get older and be tall, thought the tree. That, after all, is the most delightful thing in\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the world.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  What worldwide iniquity such a speech as that discloses, said I, still turning myself to the captain, for though\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I would have crushed them both by my words had it been possible, my dislike centred itself on Sir Ferdinando.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  There too were large easy chairs, silken sofas, large tables full of picture books and full of toys worth\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  hundreds and hundreds of crowns at least the children said so.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Time enough had he too for his reflections, for days and nights passed on, and nobody came up. And when at last\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  somebody did come it was only to put some great trunks in a corner out of the way.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Thel is like a watery bow and like a parting cloud, like a reflection in a glass, like shadows in the water,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  like dreams of i"]
[109.183077, "o", "nfants, like a smile upon an infant's face.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  She was gone out into the village on some errand when, as she was descending the steep street, her foot slipped\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  on the ice and she fell. It was dark and no one saw her mischance, till after a time her groans attracted the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  attention of a passer by.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It will be wholly impossible for you to retain the tranquility of temper and felicity of faith necessary for\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  noble purist painting, unless you are actively engaged in promoting the felicity and peace of practical life.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  So, those offices which are by right the proper employment of the leisure class are noble, such as government,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  fighting, hunting, the care of arms and accoutrements, and the like in short, those which may be classed as\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  ostensibly predatory employments,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In his return to the camp, his acute and practised intellects were intently engaged in devising means to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  counteract a watchfulness and suspicion on the part of his enemies that he knew were in no degree inferior to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  his own.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  There is no logical impossibility in the hypothesis that the world sprang into being five minutes ago, exactly\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  as it then was, with a population that remembered a wholly unreal past.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Then I, long tried by natural ills, received the comfort fast, While budding, at thy sight my pilgrim's staff\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  gave out green leaves with morning dews, imperled.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Federal judges and United States attorneys in Utah, who were not Mormons nor lovers of Mormonism, refused to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  entertain complaints, or prosecute cases under the law, because of its manifest injustice and inadequacy.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Many of these again, and also many of the other aristocracy of less degree, have in turn attached to their\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  persons a more or less comprehensive group of vicarious consumer in the persons of their wives and children,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  their servants, retainers, etc.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  She promised to do this, and she mentioned to me that when for a moment, disburdened, delighted, he held her\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  hand, thanking her for the sacrifice. She already felt rewarded.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Proscribed by the civil and ecclesiastical powers of the empire, the Donatists still maintained in some\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  provinces, particularly in Numidia, their superior numbers, and four hundred bishops acknowledged the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  jurisdiction of their primate.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and this method of treating the case was much more effectual in making them disposed to avoid committing a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  similar fault another time than any direct rebukes or expressions of displeasure addressed personally to them\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  would have been.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  If Christian perfection be necessary to salvation, I shall never be saved. My heart is a very hotbed for sinful\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  thoughts, and when I decide on an action I scarcely remember to look to my Redeemer for direction.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The English forwarded to the French baskets of flowers, of which they had made a plentiful provision to greet\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the arrival of the young princess. The French, in return, invited the English to a supper, which was to be given\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the next day.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The brown ground beneath is left for the most part. One touch of black is put for the hollow, two delicate lines\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of dark grey define the outer curve, and one little quivering touch of white draws the inner edge of the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  mandible.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K  \u001b[36m\u001b[1mStock NVIDIA NeMo \u001b[0m [██████████████████████████░░░░░░░░░░] 2,336/2,620 clips  3.92/5.40 h  \u001b[1m 13.52 s\u001b[0m"]
