[109.586252, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Her tongue was not less keen than her eye, and whenever a damsel came within earshot, seemed to take up an\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  unfinished lecture, as a barrel organ takes up a tune precisely at the point where it had left off.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  but such was his keenness that even while the wide flukes of his engorged victim were still sticking out at the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  corners of his beak, his fierce red eyes were once more peering downward into the torrent in search of fresh\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  prey.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He had no friend wise enough to tell him to step into the Dorking convention, then in session, make a sketch of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the men and women on the platform, and take it to the editor of the Daily Grapevine, and see what he could get a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  line for it.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  And then we insist upon it, the study of social deformities and infirmities, and the task of pointing them out\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  with a view to remedy, is not a business in which choice is permitted.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Miss Woodley was too little versed in the subject to know this would have been not to love at all, at least not\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  to the extent of breaking through engagements and all the various obstacles that still mitigated against their\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  union.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Who was it she was in love with? The story will tell, I took upon myself to reply. Oh, I can't wait for the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  story. The story won't tell, said Douglas, not in any literal, vulgar way. More's the pity then.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Natty Harmon tried the kitchen pump secretly several times during the evening, for the water had to run uphill\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  all the way from the well to the kitchen sink, and he believed this to be a continual miracle that might give\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  out at any moment.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  when she came to her senses, and blushing to find herself in Rodolfo's arms, would have disengaged herself. No,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Signora, he said, that must not be. Strive not to withdraw from the arms of him who holds you in his soul.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  but the proprietor appeared already to have relinquished as hopeless the effort to perpetuate on this side of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the Atlantic, in a hard soil, and amid the close struggle for subsistence, the native English taste for\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  ornamental gardening.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Braglon watched for some time the conduct of the two lovers, listened to the loud and uncivil slumbers of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Manakamp, who snored as imperiously as though he was wearing his blue and gold instead of his violet suit.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  for the great barn doors are thrown wide open, and men are busy there mending the harness under the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  superintendence of mister Goby, the widow, otherwise saddler, who entertains them with the latest Treadleston\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  gossip.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  But do not suppose that I disparage the gift which you possess, nor that I would discourage you from exercising\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  it, I only exhort you so to think of it, and so to use it, as to render it conducive to your own permanent good.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He is a welcome figure at the garden parties of the elect, who are always ready to encourage him by accepting\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  free seats for his play. Actor managers nod to him, editors allow him to contribute, without charge, to a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  symposium on the price of golf balls.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Poor Douglas, before his death, when it was in sight, committed to me the manuscript that reached him on the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  third of these days, and that, on the same spot, with immense effect, he began to read to our hushed little\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  circle on the night of the fourth,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  O little cloud, the Virgin said, I charge thee to tell me why thou complainest now when in one hour thou fade\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  away. Then we shall seek thee, but not find. Ah, thel is like to thee.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The painter who says my grinder The notary who says my skip the gutter the hairdresser who says my mealy back\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The cobbler who says my cub talks slang.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Louis "]
[109.586347, "o", "was out of danger in a fortnight. In a month he rose from his bed, and during all that time he was visited\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  daily by his mother and grandmother, and treated by the master and mistress of the house as if he was their own\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  child.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Drunkenness and the other pathological consequences of the free use of stimulants therefore tend in their turn\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  to become honorific, as being a mark at the second remove, of the superior status of those who are able to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  afford the indulgence.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Whenever the sense of familiarity occurs without a definite object, it leads us to search the environment until\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  we are satisfied that we have found the appropriate object, which leads us to the judgment. This is familiar.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Every line in which the master traces it, even where seemingly negligent, is lovely and set down with a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  meditative calmness which makes these two etchings capable of being placed beside the most tranquil work of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Holbein or Durr.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Be it said to the honour of some of the officers entrusted with a terrible commission, that when they learned\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  its true significance, they resigned their authority rather than have anything to do with what they designated a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  cold blooded butchery.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In an image of a well known face, for example, some parts may feel more familiar than others. When this happens\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  we have more belief in the accuracy of the familiar parts than in that of the unfamiliar parts.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In a sunset glowing of crimson and gold She lies, The glory of the world, A beached king's galley whose sails\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  are furled, Who is hung with tapestries rich and old,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of Mark Wilder I say this his name has been for years hateful to me, and recently it has become frightful, and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  you will promise me simply this that you will never ask me to speak again about him.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The fireball, half of it white, half azure blue, and the size of a ten inch shell, moved slowly about the raft,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  but revolving on its own axis with astonishing velocity, as if whipped round by the force of the whirlwind.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The bond of union thus effected could never be severed, and although Ben Zuf's achievements had fairly earned\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  him the right of retirement, he firmly declined all honours or any pension that might part him from his superior\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  officer.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Before the settlement of terms the administration must be possessed entirely by the parliaments of both\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  kingdoms, and how incompatible that scheme with the liberty of the king is easily imagined.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The London plant was less temporary, but not permanent, supplying, before it was torn out, no fewer than three\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  thousand lamps in hotels, churches, stores, and dwellings in the vicinity of Holborn Viaduct.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It may be that a great colourlist will use his utmost force of colour, as a singer his full power of voice, but,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  loud or low, the virtue is in both cases always in refinement, never in loudness.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He doesn't say, but it's on the frontier, and on the map everything beyond it is marked Indians and desert, and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  looks as desolate as a Wednesday meeting. Humph. It was time for 