[110.191236, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It was the white rabbit returning, splendidly dressed with a pair of white kid gloves in one hand and a large\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  fan in the other. He came trotting along in a great hurry, muttering to himself as he came Oh, the Duchess, the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Duchess\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The dependent who was first delegated for these duties was the wife, or the chief wife, and, as would be\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  expected, in the later development of the institution, when the number of persons by whom these duties are\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  customarily performed gradually narrows, the wife remains the last.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Shall I never miss home talk and blessing, and the common kiss that comes to each in turn, Nor count it strange,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  when I look up, to drop on a new range of walls and floors, another home than this?\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It is also noticeable that the serviceability of consumption as a means of repute, as well as the insistence on\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  it as an element of decency, is at its best in those portions of the community where the human contact of the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  individual is widest and the mobility of the population is greatest.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Assuredly, if the tongue which a nation or a province has spoken is worthy of interest, the language which has\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  been spoken by a misery is still more worthy of attention and study.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  We don't spin tops, is a favourite saying amongst artillery officers, indicating that they do not shirk their\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  duty by frivolous pursuits. But it must be confessed that Cervadac, being naturally idle, was very much given to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  spinning tops.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I have not asked him, Ruth replied, with a look that might imply that she was one of those determined little\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  bodies who first made up her own mind and then compelled others to make up theirs in accordance with hers.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The strong position held by the Edison system under the strenuous competition that was already springing up was\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  enormously improved by the introduction of the three wire system, and it gave an immediate impetus to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  incandescent lighting.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Brighter than early dawn's most brilliant dye are blown clear bands of colour through the sky, That swirl and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  sweep and meet, To break and foam like rainbow veils upon a bubble's dome.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The definition of my experience is difficult. Broadly speaking, it is everything that is connected with what I\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  am experiencing now by certain links, of which the various forms of memory are among the most important.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  And so, if I had been delayed by a quarter of an hour or even less, the frigate would have gone without me, and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I would have missed out on this unearthly, extraordinary, and inconceivable expedition, whose true story might\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  well meet with some scepticism.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The uncouth faces passed him two by two, stained yellow or red, or livid by the sea, and as he strove to look at\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  them with ease and indifference, a faint stain of personal shame and commiseration rose to his own face.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  One of his militia generals suggested that the governor should require the outlaws at Lawrence and elsewhere to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  surrender the Sharps rifles. Another wrote asking him to call out the government troops at Fort Leavenworth,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Like his unfortunate little cousin the teal, he too had felt the fear of death smitten into his heart, and was\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  heading desperately for the refuge of some dark overhanging bank deep fringed with weeds where the dreadful eye\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of the hawk should not discern him.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  To all appearance, Molly had got through her after dinner work in an exemplary manner, had cleaned herself with\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  great despatch, and now came to ask submissively if she should sit down to her spinning till milking time.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  You must know, said Margolot, when they were all seated together on the broad window se"]
[110.19138, "o", "at, that my husband\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  foolishly gave away all the powder of life he first made to old Momby the witch, who used to live in the country\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of the Gillikans, to the north of here.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It was idle for him to move himself to be generous towards them, to tell himself that if he ever came to their\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  gates, stripped of his pride, beaten and in beggars' weeds, that they would be generous towards him, loving him\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  as themselves.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Well, you know, Rady, women like wicked fellows. It is contrast, I suppose, but they do, and I'm sure, from what\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Bracton has said to me I know him intimately, that Dorcas likes him, and I can't conceive why they are not\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  married.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It was a look so intelligent, yet inexplicable, perverse, sometimes so malicious, but generally accompanied by a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  wild flow of spirits, that Hester could not help questioning at such moments whether Pearl was a human child.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He doesn't say exactly what it is, said Ruth, a little dubiously. But it's something about land and railroads,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and thee knows, father, that fortunes are made nobody knows exactly how, in a new country.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In the shooting of Sheriff Jones in Lawrence, and in the refusal of ex Governor Reeder to allow the deputy\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  marshal to arrest him, they discovered grave offenses against the territorial and the United States laws\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I can afford to smile because I am absolutely powerless before you. But I do not the less feel that in a matter\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of which the progress of the world is concerned, I, or rather we, have been put down by brute force.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Sheriff Jones had his pockets always full of writs issued in the spirit of persecution, but was often baffled by\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the sharp wits and ready resources of the Free State people, and sometimes defied outright.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  but this inestimable privilege was soon violated with the knowledge of truth, the emperor imbibed the maxims of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  persecution, and the sects which descented from the Catholic Church were afflicted and oppressed by the triumph\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of Christianity.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The place he had was a very good one. The sun shone on him. As to fresh air there was enough of that, and round\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  him grew many large sized comrades, pines as well as firs.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  We have always thought that it was sometimes a courageous act, and, at least, a simple and useful deed, worthy\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of the sympathetic attention which duty accepted in fulfilled merits,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I am a very unpleasant pupil, always asking questions, curious, troublesome, insatiable, and even supposing that\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I could meet with the teacher I require. I am afraid I am not rich enough to pay him.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  We sometimes have images that are by no means peculiarly vague, which yet we do not trust. For example, under\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the influence of fatigue, we may see a friend's face vividly and clearly, but horribly distorted,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  They are beyond all other works that I know existing, dependent for their effect on low, subdued tones, their\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  favourite choice in time of day being either dawn or twilight, and even their brightest sunsets produced chiefly\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  out of grey paper.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  thinks I o' myself, I never seen anything Osh Popum couldn't mend if he took time enough and glue enough. So I\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  carried this little feller home in a bushel basket one night last month, and I've spent eleven evenings putting\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  him together.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Nothing will be more precious to you, I think, in the practical study of art, than the conviction which will\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  force itself on you more and more every hour, of the way all things are bound together, little and great, in\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  spirit and in matter.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  With many variations, suggested by the nature of his building materials, diversity of climate, a"]
