[114.433598, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  it is to tenfold life, to love, to peace, and raptures wholly. Unseen descending, weigh my light wings upon\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  balmy flowers, And court the fair eyed dew to take me to her shining tent, The weeping virgin, trembling, kneels\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  before the risen sun.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  That was the chrism of love, which love's own crown, with sanctifying sweetness, did proceed, The third upon my\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  lips, was folded down in perfect purple state. Since when, indeed, I have been proud and said My love, my own.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Madame corrected me with a patronizing air for my pronunciation of the word squevre, which means divided, saying\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  that it ought to be pronounced scura, and she added that I ought to be very glad to have learned so much on the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  first day of my arrival in Paris, telling me that it would be an important day in my life.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Another case, said John Wesley, was a little girl, half grown, who was washing windows upstairs one day, and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  unluckily fell asleep in the window, and in this position was found by her mistress. In a rage the mistress hit\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  her a heavy slap, knocked her out of the window, and she fell to the pavement, and died in a few hours from the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  effects thereof.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and Wilder laughed too, more suddenly and noisily than the humour of the joke seemed quite to call for, and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  glanced a grim look from the corners of his eyes on Lake. But the gallant captain did not seem to perceive it,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and after a few seconds more he handed it very innocently back to Mrs Dorothy, only remarking\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Independent of her fortune she has beauty to captivate the heart of any man, and with all her follies, she has a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  frankness in her manner, an unaffected wisdom in her thoughts, a vivacity in her conversation, and withal a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  softness in her demeanour that might alone engage the affections of a man of the nicest sentiments and the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  strongest understanding.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  we might provisionally, though perhaps not quite correctly, define memory as that way of knowing about the past\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  which has no analogue in our knowledge of the future. Such a definition would at least serve to mark the problem\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  with which we are concerned, though some expectations may deserve to rank with memory as regards immediacy.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  This meant that for an alleged misdemeanour, for which Congress prescribed a maximum penalty of six months'\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  imprisonment and a fine of three hundred dollars, a man might be imprisoned for life, aye, for many terms of a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  man's natural life, did the court's power to enforce its sentences extend so far, and might be fined millions of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  dollars.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Sometimes he thought he would like to stand in a conspicuous pulpit and humbly preach the gospel of repentance,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and it even crossed his mind that it would be noble to give himself to a missionary life to some benighted\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  region, where the date palm grows, and the nightingale's voice is in tune, and the bulbul sings on the off\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  nights.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Then the church was disincorporated, and its property both real and personal, confiscated and eschiated to the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  government of the United States. And although the personal property was soon restored, real estate of great\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  value long lay in the hands of the court's receiver, and the Mormon church had to pay the national government\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  high rental on its own property.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Just then Leocadia came to herself, and embracing the cross seemed changed into a sea of tears, and the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  gentleman, remaining in utter bewilderment, until his wife had repeated to him from beginning to end Leocadia's\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  whole story, and he believed it, through the blessed dispensation of heaven which had confirmed it by so many\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  convincing testimonies.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The English, it is evident, had they not been previously assured of receiving the king, would never have parted\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  with so considerable a sum, and while they weakened themselves, by the same measure, have strengthened a people\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  with whom they must afterwards have so material an interest to discuss.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Among other persons of distinction who united themselves to him was Lord Napier of Murchiston, son of the famous\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  inventor of the logarithms, the person to whom the title of a great man is more justly due than to any other\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  whom his country ever produced.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  We are, of course, in fact, able to judge when we recognize an object that we have seen it before, but this\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  judgment is something over and above recognition in this first sense, and may very probably be impossible to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  animals that nevertheless have the experience of recognition in this first sense of the word.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  We may be stopped, the fact may be put to us in general terms, which is one way of attenuating it, we may be\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  told that all trades, professions, it may be added, all the accidents of the social hierarchy and all forms of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  intelligence have their own slang.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It is a very fine old place of red brick, softened by a pale, powdery lichen, which has dispersed itself with\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  happy irregularity, so as to bring the red brick into terms of friendly companionship with the limestone\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  ornaments surrounding the three gables, the windows and the doorplace.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  A quarter of an hour afterwards he returned to the theatre, but it will be readily believed that it was only a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  powerful effort of reason over his great excitement that enabled him to go back, or perhaps, for love is thus\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  strangely constituted, he found it impossible even to remain much longer separated from the presence of one who\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  had broken his heart.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Now you will see in these studies that the moment the white is enclosed properly and harmonized with the other\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  hues, it becomes somehow more precious and pearly than the white paper, and that I am not afraid to leave a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  whole field of untreated white paper all round it, being sure that even the little diamonds in the round window\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  will tell as jewels if they are graded justly.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Thus saying, and pressing the crucifix to her breast, she fell fainting into the arms of Donna Estefania, who,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  as a gentlewoman, to whose sex pity is a natural as cruelty as to man, instantly pressed her lips to those of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the fainting girl, shedding over her so many tears that there needed no other sprinkling of water to recover\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Leocadia from her swoon.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  from the respect paid her on all sides she seemed like a queen, and from the adoration with which she was\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  treated by two or three, she appeared an object of worship. The Queen mother gave the French the most\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  affectionate reception. France was her native country, and she had suffered too much unhappiness in England for\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  England to have made her forget France.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  They asserted with confidence, and almost with exultation, that the apostolical succession was interrupted, that\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  all the bishops of Europe and Asia were infected by the contagion of guilt and schism, and that the prerogatives\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of the Catholic Church were confined to the chosen portion of the African believers, who alone had preserved\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  inviolate the integrity of their faith and discipline.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Thought kills me that I am not thought, To leap large lengths of miles when thou art gone, But that so much of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  earth and water wrought, I must attend time's leisure with my moan, Receiving nought by elements so slow, But\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  heavy tears, badges of either's woe.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The colourist says, First of all, as my delicious parroquet was ruby, so this nasty viper shall be black. And\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  then is the question, can I round him off, even though he is black, and make him slimy, and yet springy and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  close down, clotted like a pool of black blood on the earth, all the same?\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Sylvia did not think that her good conduct was a merit, for she knew that she was virtuous only because her self\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  love compelled her to be so, and she never exhibited any pride or assumed any superiority towards her theatrical\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  sisters. Although satisfied to shine by their talent or their beauty, they cared little about rendering\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  themselves conspicuous by their virtue.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  She was honourably buried in the church of Saint Sauveur, without the slightest opposition from the venerable\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  priest, who, far from sharing the anti Christian intolerancy of the clergy in general, said that her profession\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  as an actress had not hindered her from being a good Christian, and that the earth was a common mother of all\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  human beings, as Jesus Christ had been the Saviour of all mankind.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The Vanderpools were sure of this, and the Englishman, instancing India, became quite eloquent. Mrs. Gray was\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  mystified but hardly dared admit it. The general trend of the conversation seemed to be that most individuals\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  needed to be submitted to the sharpest scrutiny before being allowed much education, and as for the lower races,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  it was simply criminal to open such useless opportunities to them.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Without going to any such extreme as this, we can easily see on reflection how vast an influence on the ideas\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and conceptions, as well as on the principles of action in mature years, must be exerted by the nature and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  character of the images which the period of infancy and childhood impress upon the mind.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Of course, the words this has existed before are a very inadequate translation of what actually happens when we\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  for"]
[114.433759, "o", "m a judgment of recognition, but that is unavoidable. Words are framed to express a level of thought which is\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  by no means primitive, and are quite incapable of expressing such an elementary occurrence as recognition,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  While the former foretold that the Scottish Covenanters were secretly forming a union with the English\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Parliament, and inculcated the necessity of preventing them by some vigorous undertaking, the latter still\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  insisted that every such attempt would precipitate them into measures to which otherwise they were not perhaps\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  inclined.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Hester Prynne went one day to the mansion of Governor Bellingham with a pair of gloves which she had fringed and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  embroidered to his order, and which were to be worn on some great occasion of state, for, though the chances of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  a popular election had caused this former ruler to descend a step or two from the highest rank, he still held an\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  honorable and influential place among the colonial magistracy.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  A reconciliation between the two conflicting requirements is effected by a resort to make believe. Many and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  intricate polite observances and social duties of a ceremonial nature are developed, many organizations are\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  founded, with some specious object of amelioration embodied in their official style and title. There is much\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  coming and going, and a deal of talk, to the end that the talkers may not have occasion to reflect on what is\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the effectual economic value of their traffic.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Oh,'tis the first,'tis flattery in my seeing, And my great mind most kingly drinks it up. Mine eye well knows\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  what with his gust is green, And to his palate doth prepare the cup If it be poisoned,'tis the lesser sin, That\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  mine eye loves it, and doth first begin.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K  \u001b[36m\u001b[1mStock NVIDIA NeMo \u001b[0m [██████████████████████████████████░░] 2,592/2,620 clips  5.18/5.40 h  \u001b[1m 18.79 s\u001b[0m"]
