 object,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and says, Thou mother of my children, I have loved thee, and I have given thee a crown that none can take away.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Then there were three or four leading men of the community with their wives, who were for the most part the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  fathers and mothers of the young ladies.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and gentle sleep the sleep of death, and gently hear the voice of him that walketh in the garden in the evening\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  time.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He wore blue silk stockings, blue knee pants with gold buckles, a blue ruffled waist, and a jacket of bright\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  blue braided with gold.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  This sentence also defines our sins as great, so great, in fact, that the whole world could not make amends for\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  a single sin.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
