[186.454427, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Unk knocked at the door of the house, and a chubby, pleasant faced woman, dressed all in blue, opened it and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  greeted the visitors with a smile.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I know the first letter I wrote to you is all senseless trash from beginning to end, but I am not altogether the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  idle dreaming being it would seem to denote.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Cyril, there must be some better way of doing. I just draw the outline of an animal, and then I put hairs or\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  feathers on it. They have no bodies.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  But Polly couldn't speak, and if Jasper hadn't caught her just in time, she would have tumbled over backward\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  from the stool, fronzy and all.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He wouldn't search, so don't worry, replied Cyril quietly, and the two looked at each other and knew that it was\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  so.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I think I must show you my patchwork girl, said Margolot, laughing at the boy's astonishment, for she is rather\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  difficult to explain.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I am now tall, and my branches spread like the others that were carried off last year. Oh\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  But Philip did afford it, and he wrote, thanking his friends, and declining because he said the political scheme\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  would fail, and ought to fail.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It was the first great sorrow of his life. It was not so much the loss of the cotton itself but the fantasy, the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  hopes, the dreams built around it.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  However, that was over now. The tree gone, the story at an end.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[186.454573, "o", "\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In a few hours the examination would commence, and he was still in the dilemma between making the facts public\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and allowing the culprit to compete for the valuable scholarship.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Ruth was glad to hear that Philip had made a push into the world, and she was sure that his talent and courage\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  would make a way for him.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I remained there alone for many hours, but I must acknowledge that before I left the chambers I had gradually\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  brought myself to look at the matter in another light.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  its origin was small, a germ, an insignificant seed, hardly to be thought of as likely to arouse opposition.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Another preacher, after reproaching him to his face with his misgovernment, ordered this psalm to be sung.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  So for the hundredth time she was thinking to day, as she walked alone up the lane back of the barn, and then\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  slowly down through the bottoms.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The ideas also remain, but they have become types in nature, forms of men, animals, birds, fishes,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In order to please her, I spoke to her of the Abbey Conti, and I had occasion to quote two lines of that\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  profound writer.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The bed she too well remembered was there, and above all the cabinet on which had stood the image she had taken\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  away was still on the same spot.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  By his resurrection Christ won the victory over law, sin, flesh, world, devil, death, hell, and every evil.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Hester Prynne, nevertheless, the loving mother of this one child, ran little risk of erring on the side of undue\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  severity.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Then of a sudden at midday the sun shot out, hot and still, no breath of air stirred, the sky was like blue\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  steel, the earth steamed,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  thought the fir tree, and believed it all, because the man who told the story was so good looking. Well, well,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The analysis of knowledge will occupy us until the end of the thirteenth lecture, and is the most difficult part\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of our whole enterprise.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Oh, I am speaking seriously, replied Montalay, and my opinion in this case is quite as good as the king's, I\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  suppose. Is it not, Louise?\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  But the tree did not rejoice at all. He grew and grew and was green both winter and summer.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He himself recited the same passage in French, and politely pointed out the parts in which he thought that I had\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  improved on the original.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  One day when the boy was sent by his grandfather with a message to a relation, he passed along a street in which\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  there was a great concourse of horsemen,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In strict accuracy nothing should be included under the head of conspicuous waste but such expenditure as is\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  incurred on the ground of an invidious pecuniary comparison.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  When she perceived the young man, she rose, like a woman surprised in the midst of ideas she was desirous of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  concealing from herself.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  How is it, Lavalier? said Mademoiselle de Ténéchante, that the vicomte de Bragalon spoke of you as Louise.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Stephen, leaning back and drawing idly on his scribbler, listened to the talk about him, which Heron checked\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  from time to time by saying,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In the courtyard some of the merry children were playing who had danced at Christmas round the fir tree, and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  were so glad at the sight of him.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He obtained the desired speed and load with a friction brake, also regulator of speed, but waited for an\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  indicator to verify it.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  When the blueskins saw Gipka sizzle, they raised another great shout, for he was the favourite of the soldiers\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and very popular with all the people,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The scout, who had left David at the door to ascertain they were not observed, thought it prudent to preserve\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  his disguise until assured of their privacy.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The electric light can scarcely penetrate through the dense curtain which is dropped over the theatre on which\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the Battle of the Elements is about to be waged.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Rudolfo and his companions, with their faces muffled in their cloaks, stared rudely and insolently at the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  mother, the daughter, and the servant maid.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  If you will give us your promise to meet Captain Adelax here at this time to morrow, we will stretch a point and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  delay the departure of the John Bright for twenty four hours.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I can't pray to have the things I want, he said slowly, and I won't pray not to have them, not if I'm damned for\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  it.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Then, dear, said Mrs Whitney, you must be kinder to her than ever. Think what it would be for one of you to be\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  away from home, even among friends.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It was not very much past eleven that morning when the pony carriage from Brandon drew up before the little\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  garden wicket of Redmond's farm.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  To embarrass this damaging exposure, Judge Lecomte issued a writ against the ex governor on a frivolous charge\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of contempt,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In the modern, well constructed play, he simply rings up an imaginary Confederate and tells him what he is going\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  to do. Could anything be more natural?\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Here she was teaching dirty children, and the smell of confused odors and bodily perspiration was to her at\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  times unbearable.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the weak need contingency must be strengthened and fortified, and a couple of hundred votes in one way or the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  other secured from the opposition.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I will endeavour in my statement to avoid such terms as would serve to limit the events to any particular place\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  or give a clue as to the people concerned.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Beth was a beautiful girl, the handsomest of the three cousins by far, yet Eliza surpassed her in natural charm,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and seemed well aware of the fact.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Of this second letter also she spoke, and told me that it contained an invitation for her to go and see the poet\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  if ever she visited the lakes.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[186.454598, "o", "\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The Honourable Charles Smith, Miss Sarah's brother, was walking swiftly up town from mister Easterly's Wall\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Street office, and his face was pale.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Mr Popham exaggerated nothing, but on the contrary left much unsaid in his narrative of the family at the House\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of Lords.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  She pushed him toward the big chair by the fire and sat down on a stool at the opposite side of the hearth, her\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  knees drawn up to her chin, laughing like a happy little girl.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  But if we have now ceased to advance, why do we yet leave that sail loose, which at the first shock of a tempest\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  may capsize us in a moment?\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Hilda was very nice to him, and he sat on the edge of his chair, flushed with his conversational efforts, and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  moving his chin about nervously over his high collar.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The princess sat down under a blue canopy with bouquets of roses, and she let Ander sit in a golden chair by her\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  side.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Of course he did not realize that it was I who was knocking, but nonetheless his conduct was very uncourteous,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and, indeed, under the circumstances, rather suspicious.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  But when his big brother heard that he had refused to give his cap for a king's golden crown, he said that\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Anders was a stupid.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  They unite every quality, and sometimes you will find me referring to them as colourists, sometimes as\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  chiaroscurists.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Why you said to fetch the first living creature we met, and that was the spilly goat, replied the captain,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  panting hard as he held fast to one of the goat's horns.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Fortunately, said mister Vanderpool, northerners and southerners are arriving at a better mutual understanding\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  on most of these matters.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  They were voyaging across the deserts of the sky, a host of nomads on the march, voyaging high over Ireland,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  westward bound.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Although the brethren with me are not apostles like myself, yet they are all of one mind with me, think, write,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and teach as I do.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Several clothes horses, a pillion, a spinning wheel, and an old box wide open and stuffed full of coloured rags.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I carefully avoid any appearance of preoccupation and eccentricity, which might lead those I live amongst to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  suspect the nature of my pursuits.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  any one thereabouts would have told you that this was one of the richest farms on the divide, and that the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  farmer was a woman, Alexandra Bergson.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Philip therefore read diligently in the Astor Library, planned literary works that should compel attention, and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  nursed his genius.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Everything he has done has been aimed at the conservation of energy, the contraction of space, the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  intensification of culture,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  There was something in his carriage which resembled the buoyant movements of an immortal, and he did not dance\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  so much as seemed to soar along.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Her bearing was graceful and animated, she led her son by the hand, and before her walked two maids, with wax\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  lights and silver candlesticks.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  There, in the cedar hollow then, lived Olive Lord, an angry, resentful little creature weighed down by a fierce\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  sense of injury,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The more she is engaged in her proper duties, the less leisure will she have for it, even as an accomplishment\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and a recreation.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  And now he desires to see the ideal state set in motion. He would like to know how she behaved in some great\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  struggle.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He could hardly stand still, so great was his mental agitation, and he ran towards Holmes with two eager hands\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  outstretched. Thank Heaven that you have come,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Three seconds before the arrival of J. B. Hobson's letter, I no more dreamed of chasing the unicorn than of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  trying for the North West Passage.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The lure proved too much for him, and he came sporting after it, as friskily as a young kitten, much to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Cynthia's delight when she caught sight of him.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Flight was out of the question now. The reptiles rose. They wheeled around our little raft with a rapidity\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  greater than that of express trains.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Again I thank you. This incident, I suppose, will be renewed no more. If I live to be an old woman, I shall\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  remember it thirty years hence as a bright dream.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  A stage meal is popular because it proves to the audience that the actors, even when called Charles Haltry or\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Owen Nairs, are real people just like you and me.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  She spoke with a sudden energy which partook of fear and passion, and flushed her thin cheek, and made her\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  languid eyes flash.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  To meet the needs of this conflict, wretchedness has invented a language of combat which is slang.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Yes, then something better, something still grander will surely follow. Or wherefore should they thus ornament\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  me?\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Relocated footnote. Governor Robinson being on his way east, the steamboat on which he was travelling stopped at\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Lexington, Missouri,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Now Delia contrived to obtain a great influence and ascendancy over the minds of the children by means of these\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  dolls.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  By this time Lord Chelford and Wilder returned, and, disgusted rather with myself, I ruminated on my want of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  generalship.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  They worry me terribly, and besides, I'd like to see what this lovely furniture looks like without such\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  quantities of dust all over it. Good scheme, Sin,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Kathleen waved the torch to and fro as she recited some beautiful lines written for some such purpose as that\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  which called them together to night.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I see they lay helpless and naked, weeping and none to answer, none to cherish thee with mother's smiles.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It will be clear to you from what I have said that only you could have let this young man out since you were\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  left in the room, and must have locked the door when you went out.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The king, who had from this moment become in reality the principal dancer in the quadrille, cast a look upon his\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  vanquished rival.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  pack as much into my trunk as you can, my travelling kit, my suits, shirts, and socks. Don't bother counting,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  just squeeze it all in. And hurry.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  This distinction is vital to the understanding of memory, but it is not so easy to carry out in practice as it\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  is to draw in theory.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Now then, let's enter the city and enjoy the great feast that's being cooked. I'm nearly starved myself, for\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  this conquering kingdoms is hard work.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It was a serious crime indeed, mister Watson told them, and Tom Gates bade fare to serve a lengthy term in the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  state's prison as a consequence of his rash act.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  You may be quite sure it's there, said Captain Battleaxe, and that I can so use it as to half obliterate your\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  town within two minutes of my return on board.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I wanted nothing more than to see my country again, my friends, my modest quarters by the botanical gardens, my\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  dearly beloved collections.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Yes, all alone by himself, asserted Jasper, vehemently, and winking furiously to the others to stop their\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  laughing. He did now, truly, Francie.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Women can hide their pain better than we men, and bear it better too, except when shame drops fire into the\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[186.454613, "o", "\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  dreadful chalice.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I wish it would recur again, but it will take two or three interviews before the stiffness, the estrangement of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  this long separation will wear away.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In other words, these three men took down the lectures which Luther addressed to his students in the course of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Galatians, and Rohrer prepared the manuscript for the printer.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The Lord who has given us power to teach and to hear, let him also give us the power to serve and to do. Luke\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  two.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Hold, said David, perceiving that with this assurance they were about to leave him, I am an unworthy and humble\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  follower of one who taught not the damnable principle of revenge.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The hawk, embittered by the loss of his first quarry, had become as dogged in pursuit as a weasel, not to be\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  shaken off or evaded or deceived.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In the debate between the senior societies her defence of the fifteenth Amendment had been not only a notable\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  bit of reasoning, but delivered with real enthusiasm.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  On the contrary, he resolved to tell them that repenting of his violence, and moved by her tears, he had only\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  carried her half way towards his house, and then let her go.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The consumption of luxuries, in the true sense, is a consumption directed to the comfort of the consumer\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  himself, and is, therefore, a mark of the master.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The use of the word waste as a technical term, therefore, implies no deprecation of the motives or of the ends\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  sought by the consumer under this canon of conspicuous waste.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  So I return rebuked to my content, And gain by ill thrice more than I have spent.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  She rose with a fleeting glance, gathered the shawl around her, then, gliding forward, wavering tremulous,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  slipped across the road and into the swamp.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I am not allowed to perform magic, except for my own amusement, he told his visitors, as he lighted a pipe with\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  a crooked stem, and began to smoke.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The dews were suffered to exhale, and the sun had dispersed the mists, and was shedding a strong and clear light\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  in the forest when the travellers resumed their journey.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Thou canst wait, through sorrow and sickness, To bring souls to touch, And think it soon when others cry too\u001b[0m"]
[186.454617, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  late.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Sir, I have it in command to inform your Excellency that you have been appointed governor of the Crown Colony,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  which is called Britannul.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The story of its evil influence came back to me, and in my bewildered condition I wondered whether there was not\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  some truth in what had been said.\u001b[0m"]
[186.45462, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  On the sixth of april, eighteen thirty, the Church of Jesus Christ of Latter day Saints was formally organized\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and thus took on a legal existence.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[186.454624, "o", "\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Nine thousand years have elapsed since she founded yours, and eight thousand since she founded ours, as our\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  annals record.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[186.454628, "o", "\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  While the old gold and the marble stays, Forever gleaming its soft, strong blaze Calm in the early evening glow.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Private persons who had leased the Free State Hotel vainly besought the various authorities to present the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  destruction of their property.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  For some years it was not found feasible to operate motors on alternating current circuits, and that reason was\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  often urged against it seriously.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Then he rushed downstairs into the courtyard, shouting loudly for his soldiers and threatening to patch\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  everybody in his dominions if the sailorman was not recaptured.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[186.454782, "o", "\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I heard father tell Cousin Abner that he was whipped so often for whistling when he was a boy, that he was\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  determined to have what compensation he could get now.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The helpless worm arose and sat upon the lily's leaf, and the bright cloud sailed on to find his partner in the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  vale.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  You must look at him in the face, fight him, conquer him, with what scathhe you may, you need not think to keep\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  out of the way of him.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The music came nearer, and he recalled the words, the words of Shelley's fragment upon the moon wandering\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  companionless, pale for weariness.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  And there you are. You will, of course, appreciate that the unfinished sentences not only save time, but also\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  make the manoeuvreing very much more natural.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He had a lot of line out, and the place was none too free for a long cast, but he was impatient to drop his\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  flies again on the spot where the big fish was feeding.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Her hair is still like flax, and her blue eyes are just like a baby's, and she has the same three freckles on\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  her little nose, and talks about going back to her band de mer.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  And the old gentleman was so delighted with his success that he had to burst out into a series of short, happy\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  bits of laughter that occupied quite a space of time.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Disdainful of a success of which Madame showed no acknowledgement, he thought of nothing but boldly regaining\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the marked preference of the princess.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It was silent and gloomy, being tenanted solely by the captive, and lighted by the dying embers of a fire which\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  had been used for the purpose of cookery.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He well knew that he should never see his dear old comrades, the little bushes and flowers around him any more,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  perhaps not even the birds.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The two young men, who were by this time full of the adventure, went down to the Wall Street office of Henry's\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  uncle and had a talk with that wily operator.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  After this disappointment I never dare reckon with certainty on the enjoyment of a pleasure again. It seems as\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  if some fatality stood between you and me.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Observe again what care the law took in the pursuit of wisdom, searching out the deep things of the world, and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  applying them to the use of men.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Instead of but six regularly affiliated members, and at most two score of adherents, the organization numbers\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  today many hundred thousand souls.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  There is no class and no country that has yielded so abjectly before the pressure of physical want as to deny\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  themselves all gratification of this higher or spiritual need.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The lodge in which Uncas was confined was in the very centre of the village, and in a situation perhaps more\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  difficult than any other to approach or leave without observation.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The farmer sat gloomily on the bench and would not eat, and you cannot wonder, for he saw us putting potfuls of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  his good beef and basket loads of bread into our big mouths,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It's such a crush at the yearly meeting at Arch Street, and then there's the row of sleek looking young men who\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  lie in the kerbstone and stare at us as we come out.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Till we arise linked in a golden band, and never part, but walk, united bearing food to all our tender flowers.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  She makes effort after effort, trembling with eagerness, and when she fails to reproduce what she sees, she\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  works herself into a frenzy of grief and disappointment.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  House cleaning a domestic upheaval that makes it easy for the government to enlist all the soldiers it needs.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  They informed the English Parliament of this unexpected incident, and assured them that they had entered into no\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  private treaty with the King.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Thus did the humane and right minded father comfort his unhappy daughter, and her mother, embracing her again,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  did all she could to soothe her feelings.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The Fairview band was engaged to discourse as much harmony as it could produce, and the resources of the great\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  house were taxed to entertain the guests.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I think the next glass cat the magician makes will have neither brains nor heart, for then it will not object to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  catching mice, and may prove of some use to us.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I shan't trouble you about my train of thoughts or fancies, but I began to feel very like a gentleman in a ghost\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  story, watching experimentally in a haunted chamber.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He often stopped to examine the trees, nor did he cross a rivulet without attentively considering the quantity,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the velocity, and the colour of its waters.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The news circulated with the rapidity of lightning. During its progress it kindled every variety of coquetry,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  desire, and wild ambition.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I'll gladly do that, promised the new boolaroo, and I'll feed the honourable goat all the shavings and leather\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and tin cans he can eat, besides the grass.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Well, I'm convinced that the boarded up house mystery happened not earlier than april sixteenth, eighteen sixty\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  one, and probably not much later.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It was this observation that drew from Douglas, not immediately but later in the evening, a reply that had the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  interesting consequence to which I call attention.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  And hence we find the same sort of clumsiness in the Timaeus of Plato which characterizes the philosophical poem\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of Lucretius.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and he placed it in that gentleman's fingers, who now took his turn at the lamp, and contemplated the little\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  parallelogram with a gleam of sly amusement.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  There was a bright moonlight broken by the shadows of overhanging boughs and withered leaves, and the mottled\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  lights and shadows glided oddly across his pale features.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Nemo builds a fabulous futuristic submarine, the Nautilus, then conducts an underwater campaign of vengeance\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  against his imperialist oppressor.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The principle employed in the Edison electrolytic meter is that which exemplifies the power of electricity to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  decompose a chemical substance.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  All my danger and sufferings were needed to strike a spark of human feeling out of him, but now that I am well,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  his nature has resumed its sway.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  On the mast already I see the light play of a laminat Saint Ewil's fire. The outstretched sail catches not a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  breath of wind and hangs like a sheet of lead.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The task will not be difficult, returned David, hesitating, though I greatly fear your presence would rather\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  increase than mitigate his unhappy fortunes.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Nay, I rather thrilled, distrusting every light that seemed to gild the onward path, and feared to overlean, a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  finger even,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  This, misses Poisser said, blushing, and believing that the captain was really interested in her milk pans, and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  would adjust his opinion of her to the appearance of her dairy.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Yes, I need repose. Many things have agitated me to day, both in mind and body. When you return to morrow I\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  shall no longer be the same man.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I hope thee told the elders that father and I are responsible for the piano, and that, much as thee loves music,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  thee is never in the room when it is played.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Therefore, I feel myself quite able, as President of this Republic, to receive you with a courtesy due to the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  servants of a friendly ally.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He was in the midst of that when your return caused him to make a very hurried retreat. Very hurried, since he\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  had not time to replace the papers which would tell you that he had been there.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In fact, he had just finished it. The last of the trout's tail had just vanished with a spasm down his strained\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  gullet, when the baffled hawk caught sight of him and swooped,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In fact, the sound of Madame's and the Queen's carriages could be heard in the distance upon the hard, dry\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  ground of the roads, followed by the mountain cavaliers.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It is a gleaner bringing down her one sheaf of corn to an old water mill, itself mossy and rent, scarcely able\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  to get its stones to turn.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I know his farm is in better order than any other within ten miles of us. And as for the kitchen, he added,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  smiling, I don't believe there's one in the kingdom to beat it.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The cunning man is afraid that his breath will blow upon his brothers and take away their courage too, continued\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[186.454809, "o", "\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  David, improving the hint he received they must stand further off.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  That Christ is very God is apparent in that Paul ascribes to him divine powers equally with the Father, as, for\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  instance, the power to dispense grace and peace,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  By quick marches through these inaccessible mountains that general freed himself from the superior forces of the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Covenanters.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  On either side of the road, for a mile before you reached the foot of the hill, stood tall Osage orange hedges,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  their glossy green marking off the yellow fields.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  but thou is like a faint cloud kindled at the rising sun. I vanish from my pearly throne, and who shall find my\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  place?\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Forgive me, I hardly know what I am saying. A thousand times forgive me. Madame was right, quite right. This\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  brutal exile has completely turned my brain.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  but her greeting to Captain Leake was more than usually haughty and frozen, and her features, I fancied,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  particularly proud and pale.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Bishops, virgins, and even spotless infants were subjected to the disgrace of a public penance before they could\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  be admitted to the communion of the Donatists.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The South she had not thought of seriously, and yet, knowing of its delightful hospitality and mild climate, she\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  was not averse to Charleston or New Orleans.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The queens had taken their seats upon a magnificent dais or platform erected upon the borders of the lake, in a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  theatre of wonderful elegance of construction.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The pleasant graveyard of my soul with sentimental cypress trees and flowers is filled, that I may stroll in\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  meditation at my ease.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  And the wan oracle, having spoken, she sat down in the same sort of abstraction again beside Dorcas, and she\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  looked full in her cousin's eyes.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  As the ambassador of a government is honored for his office, and not for his private person, so the minister of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Christ should exalt his office, in order to gain authority among men.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  As to any other kind of discipline, whether addressed to her mind or heart, little Pearl might or might not be\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  within its reach, in accordance with the caprice that ruled the moment.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  See, said Uncas, pointing north and south, at the evident marks of the broad trail on either side of him, the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  dark hair has gone toward the forest.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He was beginning to feel a keen interest in the slender, barefoot donkey girl who slipped in and out of the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  play, singing like someone winding through a hilly field.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the Free State men clung to their prairie towns and prairie ravines with all the obstinacy and courage of true\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  defenders of their homes and firesides.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  lives not alone, nor of itself. Fear not, and I will call The weak worm from its lowly bed, and thou shalt hear\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  its voice.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In winter, when the snow lay glittering on the ground, a hare would often come leaping along and jump right over\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the little tree.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I had always known him to be restless in his manner, but on this particular occasion he was in such a state of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  uncontrollable agitation that it was clear something very unusual had occurred.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  But, observe, you can only do this on one condition, that of striving also to create, in reality, the beauty\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  which you seek in imagination.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The Edict of Milan, the great charter of toleration, had confirmed to each individual of the Roman world the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  privilege of choosing and professing his own religion.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Before any could stop him, he butted his Majesty so furiously that the king soared far into the air and tumbled\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  in a heap among the benches, where he lay moaning and groani"]
[186.454846, "o", "ng.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  As a sample of the press comments against the brutality of the Missourians, I quote a paragraph from the Quincy\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Argus, march sixteenth, eighteen thirty nine.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  So saying, she led the way on tiptoe, followed by the children out of the room and round by a circuitous route\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  to the piazza. There\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Hostess replaces lump and inclines empty teapot over tray for a moment, then hands him a cup painted brown\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  inside, thus deceiving the gentleman with the telescope in the upper circle.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It was specially suited for a trial plant also. In the early days, when a yield of six or eight lamps to the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  horsepower was considered subject for congratulation.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In the present day we are well aware that an ancient philosopher is to be interpreted from himself and by the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  contemporary history of thought.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  One of mister Hopkins' first tasks, after calling his faithful henchmen around him, was to make a careful canvas\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of the voters of his district to see what was still to be accomplished.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Ralph Thurston had found a line of Latin for them in his beloved Horance Tibi splendet focus for you the hearth\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  fire shines.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It is black in misfortune, it is blacker still in crime. These two blacknesses, amalgamated, compose slang.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K  \u001b[36m\u001b[1mfastconformer-trt \u001b[0m [███████████████████░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░] 2,048/2,620 clips  2.95/5.40 h  \u001b[1m  2.24 s\u001b[0m"]
