top of the hansom and rubbed his pink cheek\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  with his gloved finger. Do you know I sometimes think of taking to criticism seriously myself?\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I awoke to consciousness, fighting. At first it seemed as if I was fighting with a phantom, but gradually my\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  opponent became more real to me. It was Kafir.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The Lieutenant Governor, Littleburn W. Boggs, afterward Governor, was a pronounced Mormon hater, and throughout\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the period of the Troubles he manifested sympathy with the persecutors.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Alice took up the fan and gloves, and, as the hall was very hot, she kept fanning herself all the time she went\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  on talking. Dear, dear, how queer everything is to day\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Delia came to the parlour, and with an air of great mystery, beckoned the children aside and said to them, in a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  whisper, Leave Andella and Rosalie here, and don't say a word to them.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  What a box women are put into, measured for it, and put in young. If we go anywhere, it's in a box, veiled and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  pinioned and shut in by disabilities.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  So they were quite willing to obey the orders of their girl queen, and in a short time the blast of trumpets and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  roll of drums and clashing of cymbals told Trot and Captain Bill that the blue bands had assembled before the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  palace.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  What you had best do, my child, is to keep it, and pray to it, that since it was a witness to your undoing, it\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  will deign to vindicate your cause by its righteous judgment.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The sugar manufacturer who says loaf, clarified, lumps, bastard, common, burnt this honest manufacturer talks\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  slang.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  But already at a point in economic evolution far antedating the emergence of the lady, specialized consumption\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of goods as an evidence of pecuniary strength had begun to work out in a more or less elaborate system.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He could write in one style, but not in another, and the Greek language had not as yet been fashioned by any\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  poet or philosopher to describe physical phenomena.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The princess certainly was beautiful, and he would have dearly liked to be kissed by her, but the cap which his\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  mother had made he would not give up on any condition.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Ruth asked the enthusiasts if they would like to live in such a sounding mausoleum, with its great halls and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  echoing rooms, and no comfortable place in it for the accommodation of anybody.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The first well established seat of the church was in the pretty little town of Kirtland, Ohio, almost within\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  sight of Lake Erie, and here soon rose the first temple of modern times.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Without saying it positively, she made me understand that, being herself an illustrious member of the Republic\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of Letters, she was well aware that she was speaking to an insect.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Unfortunately the fracture could not be set till six o'clock the next morning, as no surgeon was to be had\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  before that time, and she now lies at her house in a very doubtful and dangerous state.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I have great things to tell you, Signor, said Donna Estefania to her husband. The cream and substance of which\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  is this the fainting girl before you is your daughter, and the boy is your grandson,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I don't always succeed, for sometimes when I'm teaching or sewing I would rather be reading or writing, but I\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  try to deny myself, and my father's approbation amply rewarded me for the privation.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  for at the peril of her own existence, and when the other Hellen had deserted her, she repelled the invader, and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of her own accord gave liberty to all the nations within the pillars.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The ingenious Hawkeye, who recalled the hasty manner in which the other had abandoned his post at the bedside of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the sick woman, was not without his suspicions concerning the subject of so much solemn deliberation.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  One night, when he and Winifred were sitting together on the bridge, he told her that things had happened while\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  he was studying abroad, that he was sorry for, one thing in particular, and he asked her whether she thought she\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  ought to know about them.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  His legs, the best shaped at court, were displayed to great advantage in flesh coloured silken hose, of silk so\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  fine and so transparent that it seemed almost like flesh itself.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I am a woman, and there are few like me. Whoever loves me flatters me, whoever flatters me pleases me. And\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  whoever pleases well, said Montelet, you do not finish.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  There certainly was no end to it, and even Ruth was Philadelphian enough to believe that a street ought not to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  have any end or architectural point upon which the weary eye could rest.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  God bless you, friend, I do believe your scent is not greatly wrong, when the matter is duly considered, and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  keeping eternity before the eyes, though much depends on the natural gifts and the force of temptation.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Smuggling the house cleaning paraphernalia into the cellar window unobserved that afternoon proved no easy task,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  for Cynthia had added a whisk broom and dust pan to the outfit.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The whole proceeding was so childish, the miserable plot so transparent, the outrage so gross as to bring\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  disgust to the better class of border ruffians, who were witnesses and accessories.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  How strange it seemed to the sad woman, as she watched the growth and the beauty that became every day more\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  brilliant, and the intelligence that threw its quivering sunshine over the tiny features of this child.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Secure, as he thought, in the careful administration of justice in that city, and the character of its well\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  disposed inhabitants, the good Hidalgo was far from thinking that any disaster could befall his family.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  There was watercress soup and sole, and a delightful omelette stuffed with mushrooms and truffles, and two small\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  rare ducklings, and artichokes, and a dry yellow roan wine, of which Bartley had always been very fond.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Mrs Harmon thought he sang too much, and told her husband privately that if he was a canary bird, she should\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  want to keep a table cover over his head most of the time, but he was immensely popular with the rest of his\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  audience.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  On Saturday mornings, when the sodality met in the chapel to recite the little office, his place was a cushioned\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  kneeling desk at the right of the altar, from which he led his wing of boys through the responses.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  If you should not be a good girl, but should show signs of making us any trouble, I shall have to send you out\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  somewhere to the back part of the house until we are gone.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Before starting, it was indispensable that the engine of the Dobrina should be repaired. To sail under canvas\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  only would, in contrary winds and rough seas, be both tedious and difficult.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[187.066134, "o", "\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He stood a moment bewildered, then turned and rushed upon the island. A great sheet of dazzling sunlight swept\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the place, and beneath lay a mighty mass of olive green, thick, tall, wet, and willowy.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  This was the first occasion within a generation when such an entertainment had been given at Elmhurst, and the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  only when, within the memory of man, where the neighbors and country people had been the invited guests,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  They drew their swords, hid their faces in the flaps of their cloaks, turned back, and soon came in front of the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  little party, who had not yet done giving thanks to God for their escape from those audacious men.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Two years before her death I saw her perform the character of Mary Anne in the comedy of Marevaux, and in spite\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of her age and declining health, the illusion was complete.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  This was done, for the event took place at a time when the consent of the parties was sufficient for the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  celebration of a marriage, without any of the preliminary formalities which are now so properly required.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He soon foresaw that still greater economy would be necessary for commercial success, not alone for the larger\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  territory opening, but for the compact district of large cities.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  From time to time a fleecy tuft of mist, with yet some gleaming light left upon it, drops down upon the dense\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  floor of grey and loses itself in the opaque and impenetrable mass.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It is, indeed, true, that the importance of tact and skill in the training of the young, and of cultivating\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  their reason and securing their affection cannot be overrated.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  but, as before, the leaping waves of the rapids were too much for his pursuer, and he was able to flap his way\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  onward in a cloud of foam, while doom hung low above his head, yet hesitated to strike.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  His housekeeper had the management of everything. She never allowed him to be in need of anything, and she gave\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  no account of his money, which she kept altogether, because he never asked her to render any accounts.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[187.066139, "o", "\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  With many qualifications, with more qualifications as the patriarchal tradition has gradually weakened, the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  general rule is felt to be right and binding that women should consume only for the benefit of their masters.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Making their way across the river, most of the refugees found shelter among the more hospitable people of Clay\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  County, and afterward established themselves in Caldwell County, therein founding the city of far west.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[187.066213, "o", "\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  My first and principal reason was that they enforced, beyond all resistance, on any student who might attempt to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  copy them, this method of laying portions of distinct hue side by side.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  To fade away like morning beauty from her mortal day. Down by the river of Adonna her soft voice is heard, And\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  thus her gentle lamentation falls like morning dew.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  When this captain should have taken himself and his vessel back to England, I would retire to a small farm,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  which I possessed at the further side of the island, and there in seclusion would I end my days.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Though the discipline of the former parliamentary army was not contemptible, a more exact plan was introduced,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and rigorously executed by these new commanders.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Ojo became a bit uneasy at this, for he had already put quite a lot of the cleverness powder in the dish, but he\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  dared not interfere, and so he comforted himself with the thought that one cannot have too much cleverness.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  They give laws according to which images of past occurrences come into our minds, but do not discuss our belief\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  that these images refer to past occurrences, which is what constitutes knowledge memory.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The Christmas holidays came, and she and Anne returned to the parsonage, and to that happy home circle, in which\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  alone their natures expanded. Amongst all other people they shrivelled up more or less.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Pearl accordingly ran to the bow window at the further end of the hall, and looked along the vista of a garden\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  walk, carpeted with closely shaven grass, and bordered with some rude and immature attempt at shrubbery.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Though I may be but an ungracious advisor, you will allow me, therefore, to subscribe myself with the best\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  wishes for your happiness, here and hereafter, your true friend, Robert Southey.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  What the Latter day Saints call celestial marriage is characteristic of the Church, and is in very general\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  practice. But of celestial marriage, plurality of wives was an incident, never an essential.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  After pondering a while he said, If we were farther away, I should expect to find a depth of two or three\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  hundred fathoms instead of five fathoms. Five fathoms\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  From the graveyard gate one can count a dozen gaily painted farmhouses. The gilded weather vanes on the big red\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  barns wink at each other across the green and brown and yellow fields.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  But, in truth, Pearl was the one as well as the other, and only in consequence of that identity had Hester\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  contrived so perfectly to represent the scarlet letter in her appearance.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Here lay the reading of the riddle. With infinite work and pain someone had dug a canal from the lagoon to the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  creek, into which the former had drained by a long and crooked way, thus allowing it to empty directly.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  its depth remained invariable, still four or at most five fathoms, and although its bottom was assiduously\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  dredged, it was only to prove it barren of marine production of any type.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Some of the penal regulations were copied from the edicts of Diocletian, and this method of conversion was\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  applauded by the same bishops who had felt the hand of oppression and pleaded for the rights of humanity.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Mr Neverbend, began the captain, and I observed that up to that moment he had generally addressed me as\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  President. It cannot be denied that we have come here on an unpleasant mission.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  he reached up among the branches and began to pick the sweet, insipid fruit, long, ivory coloured berries,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  tipped with faint pink, like white coral, that fall to the ground unheeded all summer through.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  When she had that bad illness, and I was only eleven years old, she used to say, You'll have a friend on earth\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  in your Aunt Rachel, if I'm taken from you, for she has a kind heart, and I'm sure I've found it so.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Before this travesty on the administration of law could be brought before the court of last resort, and there\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  met with the reversal and rebuke it deserved, men were imprisoned under sentence of many years' duration.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  No words were spoken, no language was uttered save that of wailing and hissing, and that somehow was indistinct,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  as if it existed in fancy and not in reality.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  From the manner in which he expressed himself with regard to Robert Holland, no man in the whole range of his\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  recollections will be longer remembered than he. His enthrallment while under Holland will hardly ever be\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  forgotten.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Control yourselves, my dears, replied the Boolaroo. The worst punishment I know how to inflict on any one this\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  prisoner is about to suffer, you will see a very pretty patching, my royal daughters.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In one place, at the head of the room, was a raised platform for the royal family, with elegant throne chairs\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  for the king and queen, and six smaller but richly upholstered chairs for the snow nosed princesses.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Classifying was everything to him, so he knew nothing else. Well versed in the theory of classification, he was\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  poorly versed in its practical application, and I doubt that he could tell a sperm whale from a baleen whale,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The fact that it was churning day was another reason why it was inconvenient to have the widows, and why,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  consequently, Mrs. Poiser should scold Molly, the housemaid, with unusual severity.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The objection, of course, presents itself that expenditure on women's stress and household paraphernalia is an\u001b[0m"]
[187.066241, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  obvious exception to this rule, but it will appear in the sequel that this exception is much more obvious than\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  substantial.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  For in the times before the great flood, Athens was the greatest and best of cities, and did the noblest deeds,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and had the best constitution of any under the face of heaven.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The pain produced by an act of hasty and angry violence, to which a father subjects his son, may soon pass away,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  but the memory of it does not pass away with the pain.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Throughout the entire evolution of conspicuous expenditure, whether of goods or of services or human life, runs\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the obvious implication that in order to effectually mend the consumer's good fame it must be an expenditure of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  superfluities.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The trunks were moved, the tree was pulled out and thrown, rather hard, it is true, down on the floor, but a man\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  drew him towards the stairs where the daylight shone.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  all rose to do her reverence, as if something from heaven had miraculously appeared before them, but gazing on\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  her, entranced with admiration, not one of them was able to address a single word to her.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  their eyes were from the first turned in anticipation toward the evening sun, not merely that the work of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  proselyting should be carried on in the west, but that the headquarters of the church should be there\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  established.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The king's ears were now open to Montrose's counsels, who proposed none but the boldest and most daring,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  agreeably to the desperate state of the royal cause in Scotland.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  There, Messiurs Johnson and Hammer put into practice many of the ideas now standard in the art, and secured much\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  useful data for the work in New York, of which the story has just been told.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Louise hoped for excellent results from this organization, and wished the entertainment to be so effective in\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  winning their good will that they would work earnestly for the cause in which they were enlisted.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Thousands of handkerchiefs were waving above these tightly packed masses, hailing the Abraham Lincoln until it\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  reached the waters of the Hudson River at the tip of the long peninsula that forms New York City.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the count had thrown himself back on his seat, leaning his shoulders against the partition of the tent, and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  remained thus, his face buried in his hands, with heaving chest and restless limbs.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Then they sped in great haste for the door, and the goat gave a final butt that sent the row of royal ladies all\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  diving into the corridor in another tangle, whereupon they shrieked in a manner that terrified every one within\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  sound of their voices.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Let him come in, then, said the king, and as if Colbert had been listening at the door for the purpose of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  keeping himself accurrent with the conversation, he entered as soon as the king had pronounced his name to the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  two courtiers.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Henry Lord, with a degree of PhD to his credit, had been professor of zoology at a New England college, but had\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  resigned his post in order to write a series of scientific textbooks.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Then, turning towards me, he says that I look like a foreigner, and when I say that I am an Italian, he begins\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  to speak to me of the court, the city, of the theatres, and at last he offers to accompany me everywhere.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[187.066271, "o", "\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  I don't know and can't say how you fine gentlemen define wickedness only, as an obscure female, I speak\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  according to my lights, and he is generally thought the wickedest man in this county.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Why was the sacrament of the Eucharist instituted under the two species of bread and wine, if Jesus Christ be\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  present body and blood, soul and divinity, in the bread alone and in the wine alone?\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Two bites are made, and the bread is crumbled with an air of great eagerness. Indeed, one feels that in real\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  life the guest would clutch hold of the footman and say, Half a mole, chap, I haven't nearly finished. But the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  actor is better schooled than this.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Here she would stay, comforted and soothed among the lovely plants and rich exotics, rejoicing the heart of old\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Turner the gardener, who, since Polly's first rapturous entrance, had taken her into his good graces for all\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  time.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  So, to the surprise of the Democratic Committee and all his friends, mister Hopkins announced that he would\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  oppose Forbes' aggressive campaign with an equal aggressiveness, and spend as many dollars in doing so as might\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  be necessary.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  When first they entered the throne room they tried to be as haughty and scornful as ever, but the blues who were\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  assembled there all laughed at them and jeered them, for there was not a single person in all the blue country\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  who loved the princesses the least little bit.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  But Pearl, who was a dauntless child, after frowning, stamping her foot, and shaking her little hand with a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  variety of threatening gestures, suddenly made a rush at the knot of her enemies and put them all to flight.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Their diving stone, poised on its rude supports and rocking under their plunges, and the rough hewn stones of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the sloping breakwater over which they scrambled in their horse play, gleamed with cold wet lustre.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The good natured audience, in pity to fallen majesty, showed for once greater deference to the king than to the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  minister, and sung the psalm which the former had called for.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Another and far more important reason than the delivery of a pair of embroidered gloves impelled Hester at this\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  time to seek an interview with a personage of so much power and activity in the affairs of the settlement.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Here it comes, there it glides, now it is up the ragged stump of the mast, thence it lightly leaps on the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  provision bag, descends with a light bound, and just skims the powder magazine. Horrible\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Broad as the prairies and free in thought as the winds that swept them, he is idiosyncratically opposed to loose\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and wasteful methods, to plans of empire that neglect the poor at the gate,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  A small settlement had been founded by Mormon families on Shoal Creek, and here on the thirtieth of October,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  eighteen thirty eight, a company of two hundred and forty fell upon the hapless settlers and butchered a score.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Since the period of our tale, the active spirit of the country has surrounded it with a belt of rich and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  thriving settlements, though none but the hunter or the savage is ever known even now to penetrate its wild\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  recesses.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  And so life and death have dispersed the circle of violent radicals and dissenters, into which, twenty years\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  ago, the little quiet, resolute clergyman's daughter was received, and by whom she was truly loved and honored.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In other words, while he had implicit faith in the ability of Balaam's ass to speak, he was somewhat sceptical\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  on the subject of a bear's singing, and yet he had been assured of the latter on the testimony of his own\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  exquisite organs.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Unlike his master, he made no pretension to any gift of poetic power, but his inexhaustible memory made him a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  living encyclopedia, and for his stock of anecdotes and troopers' tales he was matchless.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  From the same men new regiments and new companies were formed, different officers appointed, and the whole\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  military force put into such hands as the independents could rely on.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  By a quick and unexpected march, Montrose hastened to Innerlochy and presented himself in order of battle before\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the surprised but not affrightened covenanters.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He did not think of the warm sun and of the fresh air. He did not care for the little cottage children that ran\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[187.066307, "o", "\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  about and prattled when they were in the woods looking for wild strawberries.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  simply by stopping her carriage two or three times before the shop to have her snuff box filled, and by saying\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  aloud to the young girl who handed back the box that her snuff was the very best in Paris.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Time rolled on. The hour of her delivery arrived it took place in the utmost secrecy. Her mother taking upon her\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the office of midwife, and she gave birth to a son, one of the most beautiful ever seen,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Meanwhile, he had called upon me to make a report of the three wire system, known in England as the Hopkinson,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  both doctor John Hopkinson and mister Edison being independent inventors at practically the same time.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  If a rock or a rivulet or a bit of earth harder than common severed the links of the clue they followed, the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  true eye of the scout recovered them at a distance, and seldom rendered the delay of a single moment necessary.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
