[188.2873, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  it is to tenfold life, to love, to peace, and raptures wholly. Unseen descending, weigh my light wings upon\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  balmy flowers, And court the fair eyed dew to take me to her shining tent, The weeping virgin, trembling, kneels\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  before the risen sun,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  That was the chrism of love, which love's own crown, with sanctifying sweetness, did proceed, The third upon my\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  lips, was folded down in perfect purple state. Since when, indeed, I have been proud and said, My love, my own.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Madame corrected me with a patronizing air for my pronunciation of the word squevre, which means divided, saying\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  that it ought to be pronounced scura, and she added that I ought to be very glad to have learned so much on the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  first day of my arrival in Paris, telling me that it would be an important day in my life.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Another case, said John Wesley, was a little girl, half grown, who was washing windows upstairs one day, and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  unluckily fell asleep in the window, and in this position was found by her mistress. In a rage the mistress hit\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  her a heavy slap, knocked her out of the window, and she fell to the pavement, and died in a few hours from the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  effects thereof.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and Wilder laughed too, more suddenly and noisily than the humour of the joke seemed quite to call for, and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  glanced a grim look from the corners of his eyes on Lake. But the gallant captain did not seem to perceive it,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and after a few seconds more he handed it very innocently back to Mrs Darthy, only remarking\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Independent of her fortune she has beauty to captivate the heart of any man, and with all her follies, she has a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  frankness in her manner, an unaffected wisdom in her thoughts, a vivacity in her conversation, and withal a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  softness in her demeanour that might alone engage the affections of a man of the nicest sentiments and the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  strongest understanding.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  we might provisionally, though perhaps not quite correctly, define memory as that way of knowing about the past\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  which has no analogue in our knowledge of the future. Such a definition would at least serve to mark the problem\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  with which we are concerned, though some expectations may deserve to rank with memory as regards immediacy.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  This meant that for an alleged misdemeanour, for which Congress prescribed a maximum penalty of six months'\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  imprisonment and a fine of three hundred dollars, a man might be imprisoned for life, aye, for many terms of a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  man's natural life, did the court's power to enforce its sentences extend so far, and might be fined millions of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  dollars.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Sometimes he thought he would like to stand in a conspicuous pulpit and humbly preach the gospel of repentance,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and it even crossed his mind that it would be noble to give himself to a missionary life to some benighted\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  region, where the date palm grows, and the nightingale's voice is in tune, and the bulbul sings on the off\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  nights.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Then the church was disincorporated, and its property both real and personal, confiscated and eschiated to the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  government of the United States. And although the personal property was soon restored, real estate of great\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  value long lay in the hands of the court's receiver, and the Mormon church had to pay the national government\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  high rental on its own property.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Just then Leocadia came to herself, and embracing the cross seemed changed into a sea of tears, and the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  gentleman remaining in utter bewilderment until his wife had repeated to him from beginning to end Leocadia's\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  whole story, and he believed it, through the blessed dispensation of heaven which had confirmed it by so many\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  convincing testimonies.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The English, it is evident, had they not been previously assured of receiving the king, would never have parted\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  with so considerable a sum, and while they weakened themselves, by the same measure, have strengthened a people\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  with whom they must afterwards have so material an interest to discuss.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Among other persons of distinction who united themselves to him was Lord Napier of Murchiston, son of the famous\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  inventor of the logarithms, the person to whom the title of a great man is more justly due than to any other\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  whom his country ever produced.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  We are, of course, in fact, able to judge when we recognize an object that we have seen it before, but this\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  judgment is something over and above recognition in this first sense, and may very probably be impossible to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  animals that nevertheless have the experience of recognition in this first sense of the word.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  We may be stopped, the fact may be put to us in general terms, which is one way of attenuating it, we may be\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  told, that all trades, professions, it may be added, all the accidents of the social hierarchy and all forms of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  intelligence have their own slang.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[188.287379, "o", "\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  It is a very fine old place of red brick, softened by a pale, powdery lichen, which has dispersed itself with\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  happy irregularity, so as to bring the red brick into terms of friendly companionship with the limestone\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  ornaments surrounding the three gables, the windows and the doorplace.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  A quarter of an hour afterwards he returned to the theatre, but it will be readily believed that it was only a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  powerful effort of reason over his great excitement that enabled him to go back, or perhaps, for love is thus\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  strangely constituted, he found it impossible even to remain much longer separated from the presence of one who\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  had broken his heart.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Now you will see in these studies that the moment the white is enclosed properly and harmonized with the other\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  hues, it becomes somehow more precious and pearly than the white paper, and that I am not afraid to leave a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  whole field of untreated white paper all round it, being sure that even the little diamonds in the round window\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  will tell as jewels if they are graded justly.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Thus saying, and pressing the crucifix to her breast, she fell fainting into the arms of Donna Estefania, who,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  as a gentlewoman, to whose sex pity is a natural as cruelty as to man, instantly pressed her lips to those of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the fainting girl, shedding over her so many tears that there needed no other sprinkling of water to recover\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Leocadia from her swoon.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  from the respect paid her on all sides she seemed like a queen, and from the adoration with which she was\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  treated by two or three, she appeared an object of worship. The Queen mother gave the French the most\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  affectionate reception. France was her native country, and she had suffered too much unhappiness in England for\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  England to have made her forget France.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  They asserted with confidence, and almost with exultation, that the apostolical succession was interrupted, that\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  all the bishops of Europe and Asia were infected by the contagion of guilt and schism, and that the prerogatives\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of the Catholic Church were confined to the chosen portion of the African believers, who alone had preserved\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  inviolate the integrity of their faith and discipline.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Thought kills me that I am not thought, To leap large lengths of miles when thou art gone, But that so much of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  earth and water wrought, I must attend time's leisure with my moan, Receiving nought by elements so slow, But\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  heavy tears, badges of either's woe.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The colourist says, First of all, as my delicious parroquet was ruby, so this nasty viper shall be black. And\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  then is the question, can I round him off, even though he is black, and make him slimy, and yet springy and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  close down, clotted like a pool of black blood on the earth, all the same?\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Sylvia did not think that her good conduct was a merit, for she knew that she was virtuous only because her self\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  love compelled her to be so, and she never exhibited any pride or assumed any superiority towards her theatrical\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  sisters. Although satisfied to shine by their talent or their beauty, they cared little about rendering\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  themselves conspicuous by their virtue.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  She was honourably buried in the church of Saint Sauveur, without the slightest opposition from the venerable\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  priest, who, far from sharing the anti Christian intolerancy of the clergy in general, said that her profession\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  as an actress had not hindered her from being a good Christian, and that the earth was a common mother of all\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  human beings, as Jesus Christ had been the Saviour of all mankind.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The Vanderpools were sure of this, and the Englishman, instancing India, became quite eloquent. Mrs. Gray was\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  mystified but hardly dared admit it. The general trend of the conversation seemed to be that most individuals\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  needed to be submitted to the sharpest scrutiny before being allowed much education, and as for the lower races,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  it was simply criminal to open such useless opportunities to them.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Without going to any such extreme as this, we can easily see on reflection how vast an influence on the ideas\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and conceptions, as well as on the principles of action in mature years, must be exerted by the nature and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  character of the images which the period of infancy and childhood impress upon the mind.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Of course, the words this has existed before are a very inadequate translation of what actually happens when we\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  form a judgment of recognition, but that is unavoidable. Words are framed to express a level of thought which is\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  by no means primitive, and are quite incapable of expressing such an elementary occurrence as recognition,\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[188.287406, "o", "\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  While the former foretold that the Scottish covenanters were secretly forming a union with the English\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Parliament, and inculcated the necessity of preventing them by some vigorous undertaking, the latter still\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  insisted that every such attempt would precipitate them into measures to which otherwise they were not perhaps\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  inclined.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Hester Prynne went one day to the mansion of Governor Bellingham with a pair of gloves which she had fringed and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  embroidered to his order, and which were to be worn on some great occasion of state, for, though the chances of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  a popular election had caused this former ruler to descend a step or two from the highest rank, he still held an\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  honorable and influential place among the colonial magistracy.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  A reconciliation between the two conflicting requirements is effected by a resort to make believe. Many and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  intricate polite observances and social duties of a ceremonial nature are developed, many organizations are\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  founded, with some specious object of amelioration embodied in their official style and title. There is much\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  coming and going, and a deal of talk, to the end that the talkers may not have occasion to reflect on what is\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the effectual economic value of their traffic.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Oh,'tis the first,'tis flattery in my seeing, And my great mind most kingly drinks it up. Mine eye well knows\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  what with his gust is green, And to his palate doth prepare the cup If it be poisoned,'tis the lesser sin, that\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  mine eye loves it, and doth first begin.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  A pretty girl, and so far as I could judge by appearances, a good girl, too. Describing her generally, I may say\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  that she had a small head, well carried and well set on her shoulders, bright grey eyes that looked at you\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  honestly and meant what they looked, a trim, slight little figure, too slight for our English notions of beauty,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  a strong American accent, and, a rare thing in America, a pleasantly toned voice which made the accent agreeable\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  to English ears,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In this connection, it should be mentioned that the Association of Edison Illuminating Companies in the same\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  year adopted resolutions unanimously to the effect that the Edison meter was accurate, and that its use was not\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  expensive for stations above one thousand lights, and that the best financial results were invariably secured in\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  a station selling current by meter.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  A good neighbour of the Bronte's, a clever, intelligent Yorkshire woman, who keeps a druggist shop in Haworth,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  from her occupation her experience and excellent sense, holds the position of village doctress and nurse, and,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  as such, has been a friend in many a time of trial and sickness and death in the households round, told me a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  characteristic little incident connected with Tabby's fractured leg,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  There was infinite scepticism around him on the subject, and while other inventors were also giving the subject\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  their thought, the public took it for granted that anything so utterly intangible as electricity, that could not\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  be seen or weighed, and only gave secondary evidence of itself at the exact point of use, could not be brought\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  to accurate registration.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Then now let me explain to you the order of our entertainment. First, Timaeus, who is a natural philosopher,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  will speak of the origin of the world, going down to the creation of men, and then I shall receive the men whom\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  he has created, and some of whom will have been educated by you, and introduce them to you as the lost Athenian\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  citizens, of whom the Egyptian records spoke.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  American schoolboys read with emotions of horror of the Albigenses, driven, beaten and killed, with a papal\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  legate directing the butchery, and of the vaudois hunted and hounded like beasts, as the effect of a royal\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  decree. And they yet shall read in the history of their own country of scenes as terrible as these, in the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  exhibition of injustice and inhuman hate.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Ben Zouf's most ambitious desire was to induce the captain to go with him and end his days in his much loved\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  home, and so incessantly were Servadac's ears besieged with descriptions of the unparalleled beauties and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  advantages of this eighteenth arrondissement of Paris, that he could scarcely hear the name of Montmartre\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  without a conscious thrill of aversion.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Dreading the superior power of Argyll, who, having joined his vassals to a force levied by the public, was\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  approaching with a considerable army, Montrose hastened northward in order to rouse again the Marquis of Huntley\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and the Gordons, who, having before hastily taken arms, had been instantly suppressed by the covenanters.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  In a moment he communicated his thoughts to his companions, and in the next moment they resolved to turn back\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and carry her off to please Rudolfo. For the rich, who are open handed always find parasites ready to encourage\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  their bad propensities, and thus to conceive this wicked design, to communicate it, approve it, resolve on\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  ravishing Leocadia, and to carry that design into effect was the work of a moment.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  He passes abruptly from persons to ideas and numbers, and from ideas and numbers to persons, from the heavens to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  man, from astronomy to physiology. He confuses, or rather, does not distinguish subject and object, first and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  final causes, and is dreaming of geometrical figures lost in a flux of sense.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  valor, indeed, was very generally diffused over the one party as well as the other. During this period\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  discipline also was attained by the forces of the Parliament, but the perfection of the military art in\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  concerting the general plans of action and the operations of the field seems still on both sides to have been in\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  a great measure wanting.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  he must descend with his heart full of charity and severity at the same time, as a brother and as a judge, to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  those impenetrable casemates, where crawl pell mell those who bleed and those who deal the blow, those who weep\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and those who curse, those who fast and those who devour, those who endure evil and those who inflict it,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  My eyes fill with tears when I contrast the bliss of such a state, brightened by hopes of the future, with the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  melancholy state I now live in, uncertain that I ever felt true contrition, wandering in thought and deed,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  longing for holiness which I shall never, never obtain, smitten at times to the heart, with the conviction that\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  ghastly Calvinistic doctrines are true, darkened in short by the very shadows of spiritual death,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  This severity by which Montrose sullied his victories was the result of private animosity against the chieftain,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  as much as of zeal for the public cause. Argyll, collecting three thousand men, marched in quest of the enemy,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  who had retired with their plunder, and he lay at Innerlochy, supposing himself still at a considerable distance\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  from them.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Well, as I say, it's an awful queer world. They clap all the burglars in jail and the murderers and the wife\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  beaters. I always thought a gentle reproof would be enough punishment for a wife beater,'cause he probably has a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  lot of provocation that nobody knows. And the firebugs"]
[188.287441, "o", ", can't think of the right name, something like\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  sendiaries. And the breakers of the peace and what not, and yet the law has nothin' to say to a man like\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Hanlord.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  So persuasive were her entreaties, and so strong her assurances that no harm whatever could result to them from\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  the information she sought, they were induced to confess that one summer's night, the same she had mentioned,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  themselves and another friend being out on a stroll with Rodolfo, they had been concerned in the abduction of a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  girl, whom Rodolfo carried off, whilst the rest of them detained her family, who made a great outcry, and would\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  have defended her if they could.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  you are now in the only country in the world where wit can make a fortune by selling either a genuine or a false\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  article. In the first case, it receives the welcome of intelligent and talented people, and in the second, fools\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  are always ready to reward it, for silliness is truly a characteristic of the people here, and however wonderful\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  it may appear, silliness is the daughter of wit.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  To the surprise of all, and especially of Lieutenant Procope, the line indicated a bottom at a nearly uniform\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  depth of from four to five fathoms, and although the sounding was persevered with continuously for more than two\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  hours over a considerable area, the differences of level were insignificant, not corresponding in any degree to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  what would be expected over the site of a city that had been terraced like the seats of an amphitheatre.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Law seemed to him well enough as a science, but he never could discover a practical case where it appeared to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  him worth while to go to law, and all the clients who stopped with this new clerk in the anteroom of the law\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  office where he was writing, Philip invariably advised to settle, no matter how, but settle, greatly to the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  disgust of his employer, who knew that justice between man and man could only be attained by the recognized\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  processes with the attendant fees.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  But reckoning time, whose millioned accidents creep in twixt vows, and change decrees of kings, Tan's sacred\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  beauty, blunt the sharpest intense, Diverts strong minds to the course of altering things. Alas, why fearing of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  time's tyranny? Might I not then say, Now I love you best, When I was certain o'er in certainty, Crowning the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  present, doubting of the rest?\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Hetty Searle often took the opportunity, when her aunt's back was turned, of looking at the pleasing reflection\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of herself in those polished services, for the oak table was usually turned up like a screen, and was more for\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  ornament than for use, and she could see herself, sometimes, in the great round pewter dishes that were arranged\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  on the shelves above the long deal dinner table, or in the hobs of the grate which always shone like jasper.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  This happened every year, and the young fir tree that had now grown to a very comely size trembled at the sight,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  for the magnificent great trees fell to the earth with noise and cracking, the branches were lopped off, and the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  trees looked long and bare. They were hardly to be recognized, and then they were laid in carts, and the horses\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  dragged them out of the wood.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  To keep afloat and to rescue from oblivion, to hold above the gulf, were it but a fragment of some language\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  which man has spoken and which would otherwise be lost, that is to say, one of the elements, good or bad, of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  which civilization is composed, or by which it is complicated, to extend the records of social observation, is\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  to serve civilization itself.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  But there is always a stronger sense of life when the sun is brilliant after rain, and now he is pouring down\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  his beams, and making sparkles among the wet straw, and lighting up every patch of vivid green moss on the red\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  tiles of the cowshed, and turning even the muddy water that is hurrying along the channel to the drain into a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  mirror for the yellow billed ducks, who are seizing the opportunity of getting a drink, with as much body in it\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  as possible.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[188.287457, "o", "\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  The lily of the valley, breathing in the humble grass, answered the lovely maid and said, I am a watery weed,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and I am very small, and love to dwell in lowly vales. So weak the gilded butterfly scarce perches on my head,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  yet I am visited from heaven, and he that smiles on all walks in the valley, and each morn over me spreads his\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  hand, saying, Rejoice, thou humble grass, thou newborn lily flower,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  As the chase drives away, Mary stands bewildered and perplexed on the doorstep, her mind in a tumult of\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  excitement, in which hatred of the doctor, distrust, and suspicion of her mother, disappointment, vexation, and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  ill humor surge and swell among those delicate organizations on which the structure and development of the soul\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  so closely depend, doing perhaps an irreparable injury.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  As she awaited her guests she surveyed the table with both satisfaction and disquietude, for her social\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  functions were few. To night there were, she checked them off on her fingers, Sir James Crichton, the rich\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  English manufacturer and Lady Crichton, Mr. and Mrs. Vanderpool, Mr. Harry Creswell and his sister, John Taylor\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  and his sister, and Mr. Charles Smith, whom the evening papers mentioned as likely to be United States Senator\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  from New Jersey, a selection of guests that had been determined unknown to the hostess by the meeting of cotton\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  interests earlier in the day.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  Yesterday you were trembling for a health that is dear to you. To-day you fear for your own. To morrow it will\u001b[0m"]
[188.287469, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  be anxiety about money, the day after, to morrow the diatribe of a slanderer, the day after that the misfortune\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  of some friend, then the prevailing weather, then something that has been broken or lost, then a pleasure with\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[2m  which your conscience and your vertebral column reproach you. Again, the course of public affairs.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2K  \u001b[36m\u001b[1mfastconformer-trt \u001b[0m [████████████████████████████████████] 2,620/2,620 clips  5.40/5.40 h  \u001b[1m  4.00 s\u001b[0m"]
